<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohaannisa Mishiraachchuwaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohaannisi S'aafeedda Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohaannisa Mishiraachchuwaa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohaannisi S'aafeedda</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="it">Yohaannisi s'aafeedda mishiraachchuu, Yesuusi ashuwaa mayyiide asaa gidduwaan beetteedda De'uwaa S'oossaa K'aalaa gidiyaawaa k'onc'c'issee. Ha mas'aafay bare huup'ew k'onc'c'issiyaawaadan ha Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalay s'aafetteeddawe, Aa nabbabiyaa Asay Yesuusi asaa ashshiyaa d'aliyaa gidiide yaanawaa geetetteedda S'oossaa Na'aa gidiyaawaa ammanana malanne aan ammano gaasuwaan med'inaa de'uu unttunttoo de'anawaa unttunttu erana mala s'aafetteedda</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:31">20:31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaw koyro shaakuu Med'inaa S'oossaa k'aalaynne Yesuusinne ittuwaa gidiyaawaa odi simmiide, Yesuusi ashshiyaawaa gidiide yaana geetetteedda S'oossaa Na'aa gidiyaawaa bessiyaa dumma dumma malaatatuwaa shiishshee. Hewaappe kaalliide k'ay ha malaatatuwaappe beetteedda ayfiyaa odiyaa taarikatuu kaalliino. Ha kifilii itti itti Asay Yesuusan ammaniide, Aa kaalliyaawantta gideeddawaa odee; haratuu k'ay Aa ayaw is's'eeddenttonne aan ayaw ammanokko geeddentto odiino. (Shemppuwaa <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13-17">13—17</ref></char>) Yesuusi oyk'etteedda omarssi aw Aa kaalliyaawanttunna ay keena mino ittipetetsay de'inttonne, k'ay I kak'ettanaw mateedda wonttetsa gallassi unttunttoo giigettana malanne minnana mala I haasayeedda k'aalaa odiino. Wurssetsaa shemppatuu Yesuusi oyk'etteeddawaanne pirddaw shiik'eeddawaa, Aa kak'uwaanne Aa dendduwaa, k'aykka dendduwaappe guyyiyaan barena kaalliyaawanttoo I k'onc'c'eedda hanotaa odiino.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohaannisi Godaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosa baggana beettiyaa Med'inaa De'uwaa k'onc'c'iyaan bessiyaa ha aad'd'o keekatetsay ha"ippe doommiide Yesuusi oge, tumanne de'o gidiyaawaa ammaniyaawanttussa. Yohaannisi s'aafeedda mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa haratuwaappe dummayiyaawe, ayaanaa tumatetsatuwaa tamaarissanaw de'uwaa ubbaan Asay meezeteedda k'aalatuwaa go"ettiyaa diraassa. Hewanttukka, haatsaa, sooluwaa, poo'uwaa, hentsanchchaa, dorssaa, woyniyaa mitsaa, woyniyaa ayfiyaanne hewantta malatiyaawantta.</para>
  <para style="ip">Woshummaadde oyk'etteedda mishiratti taarikiyaa <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 7:53-8:11">7:53—8:11</ref></char> c'ora biletsatuunne beni mas'aafatuu barenttun gujjikkino; haratuu Yohaannisa mishiraachchuwaan <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 21:24">21:24</ref></char> ppe guyyiyaan gelissiino; haranttu k'ay Luuk'aasa mishiraachchuwaa <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 21:38">Luk'. 21:38</ref></char> ppe guyyiyaan gelissiino; itti beni s'aafetteedda biletsay Yohaannisa mishiraachchuwaa <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 7:36">7:36</ref></char> ppe guyyiyaan gelisseedda.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Ha Mas'aafaa s'aafeeddawaa k'ofaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisanne Yesuusa koyro kaalleeddawantta <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa oosuwaa doometsaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusaalameninne izi yuushshuwaan wurssetsaa gallassatuwaan haneedda Yesuusa oosuwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Godaa Yesuusa dendduwaanne k'onc'c'etsaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssetsaa k'utiyaa, Galiilaan zaariide barena kaalliyaawanttoo Yesuusi k'onc'c'eeddawaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">De'uwaa K'aalaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>K'aalay koyro de'ee; k'aalaykka S'oossaanna ittippe de'ee; k'aalaykka S'oossaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>I koyroppekka S'oossaanna de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Ubbabay k'aalaa baggana med'etteedda. Med'etteeddabaan ubbabaan I baynnaan ittibaynne med'ettibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Aan de'uu de'ee; de'uu asaw poo'uwaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Poo'uu d'umaan poo'ee; d'umay poo'uwaa s'oonibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>S'oossaappe kiitetti yeedda Aa suntsay Yohaannisa geetettiyaa itti bitanii de'ee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mat. 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-2">Luk'. 3:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Asay ubbay Aa baggana ammanana mala, poo'uwaabaa markkattanaw yeedda. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Poo'uwaabaa markkattanaw yeeddappe attin, I bare huup'ew poo'uwaa gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Ikka tumu poo'uwaa gideeddawe asaw poo'issanaw ha sa'aa yiyaawaa.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>K'aalay alamiyaan de'ee; S'oossay K'aalaan alamiyaa med'd'eedda; shin alamii Aa eribeenna. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>I bare baggatuwaakko yeedda; shin unttunttu Aa shiishshi akkibeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Gidoppe attin I barena shiishshi akkeedda ubbatoo, bare suntsaan ammaneeddawanttoo, S'oossaa naanaa gidana mala, maataa immeedda. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Unttunttu S'oossaappe yeletteeddinoppe attin, Asay yeliyaa maaraan woy ashuwaa sheniyaan woy attuma asaa sheniyaa s'alalaan yelettibeykkino.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>K'aalay asaa gidiide, aad'd'o keekatetsaaninne tumatetsaan kumiide nu gidduwaan de'eedda. Nuuni, I bare aabboo itti Na'aa gidiide akkeedda aw de'iyaa bare Aawuwaa bonchchuwaa be'eeddo.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yohaannisi aabaa bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Taani, ‹Taappe kaala yiyaawe taappe bollaa; ayaw gooppe, ta yeletanaappe kasenna I de'iyaawaa› gaade hinttenttoo odowe hawaa» yaagi markkatteedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Nuuni ubbay Aa kumentsaa aad'd'o keekatetsaan palaheedda anjjuwaa akkeeddo. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>S'oossay higgiyaa Muse baggana immeedda; shin aad'd'o keekatetsaynne tumatetsay Yesuusi Kiristtoosa baggana yeedda. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>S'oossaa be'eedda Asay ooninne baawa; bare Aawuwaa matan de'iyaa bare huup'ew S'oossaa gideeddawe itti Na'aa s'alalay aabaa markkatteedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa Markkatetsaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk'. 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Yerusaalamen de'iyaa Ayihudatuwaa ayissiyaawanttu k'eesatuwaanne Leewatuwaa Yohaannisakko, «Neeni oonee?» giide Aa oochchana mala kiittina, Yohaannisi unttunttoo markkatteedda markkatetsay hawaa.<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Yohaannisi, «Taani Kiristtoosa gidikke» yaagiide geeshshi markkatteeddawaappe attin, markkattussaa is's'ibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Unttunttu, «Yaatina, neeni oonee? Neeni Eelaasee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohaannisi, «Aa gidikke» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">K'aykka unttunttu, «Neeni nabee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohaannisi, «Gidikke» yaagi zaareedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Zar. 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Unttunttu, «Yaatina neeni oonee? Nuuni nuuna kiitteeddawanttoo odana mala, neeni neena oona gay?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yohaannisi zaariide, «Nabiyaa Isiyaasi geeddawaadan, woraan bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">« ‹Godaa ogiyaa sitti ootsite!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">giyaa kooshshay tawaa»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>K'ay Parisaawatuu kiitteedda asatuu <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>Yohaannisa, «Neeni Kiristtoosa woy, Eelaasa woy nabiyaa gidana d'ayooppe, yaatina ayaw s'ammak'ay?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yohaannisi, «Taani haatsaan s'ammak'ay; shin hinttenttu erennawe ittuu hawaan hinttenttu gidduwaan de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>I taappe kaala yee. Taani Aa c'aammaa k'ashuwaa billanawukka bessikke» yaagi zaareedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Hawe ubbay Yorddaanoosa Shaafaappe hefintsa bagga Yohaannisi s'ammak'iyaasaa Biitaaniyaan haneedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'oossaa Orgge Dorssaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Yohaannisi wonttetsa gallassi Yesuusi barekko yiyaawaa be'iide, «S'oossaa orgge dorssaa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">S'oossaa orgge dorssaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paasigaa (kessuwaa), Ayihude asatuwaa payduwaan Niisaan geetettiyaa agenaa gidiide Top'p'iyaa asaa payduwaan laappuniyaanne hosppuniyaa agenatuwaa. Ayihude asaan Paasigaa geetettowe, S'oossay Israa'eeliyaa asatuwaa Gibs'eppe wolk'k'aama malaataan kesseedda wodiyaa gidiyaa diraassa. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 23:5-8">Wog. 23:5-8</ref></char> s'eellite. <char style="fq" closed="false">S'oossaa Orgge Dorssaa, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ooratsa C'aak'uwaan Kiristtoosan s'eeseetto gaasuu, I ha alamiyaa asaa hayk'oo barena aatsi immiide med'inaa muraappe kessi akko diraassa. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 5:7">1 K'or. 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:18-19">1 P'es'. 1:18-19</ref></char> s'eellite.</note> Alamiyaa asaa nagaraa d'ayissiyaawe, hawesh! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Taani, ‹Taappe kaala ittuu yaanawaa; I taappe bollaa; ayaw gooppe, ta yelettanaappe kasenna I de'iyaawaa› gaade odeeddawe hawaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>I oonentto taani erikke; shin Israa'eeliyaa asaw Aa k'onc'c'issanaw haatsaan s'ammak'aadde yaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Yohaannisi markkattiidde, «Geeshsha Ayyaanay saluwaappe harap'p'iyaadan wod'd'ishiinanne Aa bollan uttishshin, taani be'aaddi. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Taani Aa erikke; shin haatsaani s'ammak'ana mala taana kiitteedda S'oossay, ‹Geeshsha Ayyaanay wod'iide, itti asaa bolla shemppishshin, neeni be'ana; ikka Geeshsha Ayyaanaan s'ammak'ee› yaagiide taw odeedda. <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Taani hewaa be'aaddi; I S'oossaa Na'aa gidiyaawaakka markkattay» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Koyro Barena Kaalliyaawantta Dooreedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Wonttetsa gallassi Yohaannisi shirettiidekka barena kaalliyaawanttuppe laa"atuwaanna ittippe ek'k'eedda; <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>I Yesuusi aad'd'ishshin be'iide, «S'oossaa dorssay hawesh!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Yohaannisa kaalliyaa laa"atuu Yohaannisi giyaawaa sisiide, Yesuusa kaalleeddino. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta guyye simmi be'iide, «Ayaa koyyiitee?» yaagi oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Unttunttu zaariide, «Rebii, neeni hak'an de'ay?» yaageeddino. «Rebii» guussay «Tamaarissiyaawoo» giyaawaa.<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Haa yiide be'ite» yaageedda. Unttunttu biide, I de'iyaasaa be'eeddino; he gallassi sa'ay tammu saate heera gidiyaa diraw, unttunttu aanana peesheeddino.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Yohaannisi geeddawaa sisiide, Yesuusa kaalleedda laa"u asatuwaappe ittuu, Simoona P'es'iroosa ishaa Inddiraasa. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Inddiraase koyro bare ishaa Simoona demmiide, «Nuuni S'oossay kiitteeddawaanna gaketteeddo» yaageedda. Hewaa guussay «Kiristtoosa» giyaawaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Inddiraase Simoona Yesuusakko aheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesuusi Simoona be'iide, «Neeni Yohaannisa na'aa Simoona; ne suntsay Keefaa geetettanawaa» yaageedda. «Keefaa» giyaawaa biletsay «P'es'iroosa» woy «Zaallaa» giyaawaa.<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Pilip'oosanne Naatinaa'eela S'eegeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Wonttetsa gallassi Yesuusi Galiilaa baanaw k'ofaa k'achcheedda; I Pilip'p'oosanna gakettiide, «Taana kaala!» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Pilip'oosi, Inddiraasinne P'es'iroose de'eedda Beetesayda geetettiyaa katamaappe yeedda asaa.<verse eid="JHN 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Pilip'oosi Naatinaa'eelanna gakettiide, «Muse mas'aafatuwaaninne Nabatuwaa mas'aafatuwaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:45 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Muse mas'aafatuwaaninne Nabatuwaa mas'aafatuwaan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihudatuwaa mas'aafaa, Ec'a C'aak'uwaa.</char></note> aabay s'afetteeddawaadan, Yooseefo na'aa Yesuusi Naazireete katamaan de'iyaawaanna nuuni gaketteeddo» yaagi odeedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Naatinaa'eeli zaariide, «Naazireete katamaappe lo"obay kesanaw danddayii?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Pilip'oosi, «Yaade be'a» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Naatinaa'eeli barekko yiyaawaa Yesuusi be'iide, «Makkalay baynna tumu Israa'eeliyaa Asay hawaa!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Naatinaa'eeli Yesuusa, «Neeni taana hak'an eray?» yaagi oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesuusi zaariide, «Pilip'oosi neena s'eesanaappe kase, neeni balasiyaa geetettiyaa mitsaappe hirkkinna de'ishshin, taani neena be'aaddi» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Naatinaa'eeli zaariide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, neeni S'oossaa Na'aa! Neeni Israa'eeliyaa kaatiyaa!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesuusi, «Taani neena balasiyaa geetettiyaa mitsaappe hirkkinna be'aaddi geedda diraw ammanay? Neeni hawaappe aad'd'iyaawaa be'ana!» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>K'aykka Yesuusi, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; saluu dooyettina, S'oossaa kiitanchchatuu ta bolla, Asaa Na'aa bolla, pude kesishshiinanne duge wod'd'ishiin, hinttenttu be'ana» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Dom. 28:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi K'aanaa Katamaa Bullachchaasaa Beedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Heezzentso gallassi Galiilaa gadiyaan K'aanaa geetettiyaa katamaan bullachchay bullachchetteedda; Yesuusa daaya he bullachchaan de'aw. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yesuusikka barena kaalliyaawanttunna ittippe he bullachchaa s'eesetteedda. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Woynniyaa ushshay wuri diggina, Yesuusa daaya Aa, «Unttunttoo woyniyaa ushshay wuri diggeedda» yaaga oochchaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Ta daayee, hawe ta oosuwaa gidiyaa diraw, ne yayana koshshenna. Ta wodii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ta wodii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay Yesuusa tumu bonchchuu be'ettanaw besseenne I S'oossaa Na'aa gidowe erettanaw bessee giyaawaa.</char></note> biro gakkibeenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Yesuusa daaya kiitettiyaawanttoo, «I hinttenttoo odiyaawaa ayaa gidooppenne ootsite» yaaga odaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Ayihudatuu kase ootsiyaa dooyaadan, meechchaa wogaw ittuu ittuu s'eetu s'aaramusiyaa oyk'k'iyaa usuppun shuchchaa baatsatuu hewan de'iino. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesuusi kiitettiyaawantta, «Baatsatuwaan haatsaa kuntsite» yaageedda; geetettowaadankka unttunttu baatsatuwaan doonaa gakkanaw haatsaa kuntseeddino. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Ha"i duuk'k'iide, bullachchaa kaappoo immite» yaageedda; unttunttu aw afiide immeeddino.<verse eid="JHN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Bullachchaa kaappuu woyniyaa ushshaa gideedda haatsaa gans's'i s'eelliide, hak'appe yeeddentto eribeenna; shin haatsaa kuntseedda oosanchchatuu eriino. Bullachchaa kaappuu machchatto akkiyaawaa s'eesiide, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>«Ooninne ayife gideedda woyniyaa ushshaa imatsaa asaa kasetiide ushshee; yaatiide Asay darssi usheeddawaappe guyyiyaan, k'iraariyaa ushshee. Shin neeni ayife gideedda woyniyaa ushshaa hanno gakkanaw naagaadda!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Yesuusi bare ootseedda wolk'k'aama malaatatuwaappe hawaa koyruwaa Galiilaa gadiyaan K'aanaa geetettiyaa heeraan ootseedda; hewan bare bonchchuwaa I k'onc'c'issina, Aa kaalliyaawanttu aan ammaneeddino.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi bare daayinna, bare ishatuwaannanne barena kaalliyaawanttunna ittippe K'ifirinaahooma geetettiyaa katamaa biide amareeda gallassaa takkeeddino.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaa Gibbiyaappe Zal"iyaawantta Kesseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat. 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar. 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk'. 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Ayihudatuu bonchchiyaa Paasigaa Baalaa gallassay matattina, Yesuusi Yerusaalame beedda. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Geeshsha Golliyaa gibbiyaan miizzaa, dorssaanne dogommatuwaa zal"iyaa asaa demmeedda; k'ay haratuu barenttu oydiyaan uttiide, miishshaa laammiyaawantta demmeedda. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>I golaa jiraafiyaa dook'k'iide, asaa ubbaa dorssaannanne miyaanna Geeshsha Golliyaa gibbiyaappe karew kessiide yederisseedda. Miishshaa laammiyaawanttu oydiyaakka aatsi yeggiide, unttunttu miishshaa laaleedda. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Dogommuwaa zal"iyaawantta I, «Ha dogommatuwaa hawaappe kessite; Ta Aabbu golliyaa geyaa ootsoppite!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu S'oossaa mas'aafan, «Taani ne gollew seelettiyaa seelay taana tamaadan guuddee» geetettiide s'aafetteeddawaa hassayeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Maz. 69:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Hewaappe guyye, Ayihude asaa ayissiyaawanttu zaariide, «New hawaa ootsanaw danddayiyaa maatay de'iyaawaa nuuna ayaa malaataa bessanii?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesuusi, «Ha Geeshsha Golliyaa kolite; taani heezzu gallassaan zaaraade kees's'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>K'aykka Ayihude asaa ayissiyaawanttu, «Ha Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'anaw oytamanne usuppun laytsaa akkeedda; shin neeni heezzu gallassaan kees's'anii?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Shin I haasayeedda Geeshsha Gollii bare asatetsaabaa. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Hewaa diraw, Yesuusi hayk'uwaappe denddeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu I hewaa geeddawaa hassayeeddino. K'ay unttunttu S'oossaa Mas'aafay geeddawaanne Yesuusi haasayeeddawaa ammaneeddino.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Paasigaa baalaa bonchchiyaa wode, Yesuusi Yerusaalamen de'ishshin, I ootseedda malaataa be'iide, c'ora Asay Aa ammaneeddino. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Shin Yesuusi asaa ubbaa eriyaa diraw, hewantta ammanibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Asaabaa ooninne aw markkattana mala koyyibeenna; ayaw gooppe, asaa wozanaan ayee de'intto, I bare huup'ew eriyaa diraassa.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Nik'oodimoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Parisaawatuwaappe gideedda kaappuwaa Nik'oodimoosa geetettiyaa itti bitanii de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Nik'oodimoosi k'amma Yesuusakko yiide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, neeni nuuna tamaarissana mala S'oossay kiitteedda gidiyaawaa nuuni ereetto; ayaw gooppe, S'oossay aanana de'iyaa asaappe attin, ha neeni ootsiyaa wolk'k'aama malaatatuwaa ootsanaw danddayiyaa Asay baawa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Taani new tumuwaa oday; Asay laa'entsuwaa yelettana d'ayooppe, S'oossaa kawutetsaa be'anaw danddayenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nik'oodimoosi, «C'ima Asay waaniide laa'entsuwaa yelettanaw danddayii? Bare daay uluwaa simmi geliide, laa'entsuwaa yelettanaw Asay danddayii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Taani new tumuwaa oday; Asay haatsaappenne Geeshsha Ayyaanaappe yelettana d'ayooppe, S'oossaa kawutetsaa gelanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Asay ashuwaan asaappe yelettee; shin Asay ayyaanaan Geeshsha Ayyaanaappe yelettee; <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>‹Hinttenttu laa'entsuwaa yelettanaw bessee› gaade taani odeedda diraw, maalalettoppa. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>C'arkkuu bare koyyeeddasaa c'arkkee. Neeni Aa kooshunchchaa sisaasa; shin I hak'appe yintto woy hak'a bintto erakka. Geeshsha Ayyaanaappe yeletteedda ubbay hewaa mala» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nik'oodimoosi, «Hawe waaniide hananaw danddayii?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Neeni Israa'eelatuwaa tamaarissiyaawaa gidaadde hawaa erikkii? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Taani new tumuwaa oday; nuuni eriyaawaa haasayeettonne be'eeddawaa markkatteetto; shin nuuni markkattiyaawaa hinttenttu akkikkita. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Taani hinttenttoo sa'aabaa odina, ammanennawantta gidooppe, saluwaabaa odina waan ammananitee? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Saluwaappe wod'd'eedda taappe attin, saluwaa keseeddawe ooninne baawa; saluwaan de'iyaa Asaa Na'ay taana.<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14-15"/>«Muse woraan s'ank'k'imaaluwaa shooshshaa sulleeddawaadan, taana ammaneedda ubbay med'inaa de'uwaa akkana mala, taani Asaa Na'ay mask'k'aliyaa bolla pude denddana bessee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Pay. 21:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:14-15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>«S'oossaa Na'aa ammaniyaa ubbay med'inaa de'uwaa akkanaappe attin, d'ayenna mala, S'oossay ha alamiyaa asaa loytsi siik'eedda diraw, bare mes's'i itti Na'aa immeedda. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Ayaw gooppe, S'oossay bare Na'aa ha alamiyaa asaa pirddanaw kiittibeenna; shin unttuntta Aa baggana ashshanaw kiitteedda.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>«Aa Na'aa ammaniyaa ooninne pirddettenna; shin Na'aan ammanenna ooninne, S'oossaa Na'aa ittuwaa ammanibeenna diraw, ha"ikka pirddetti utteedda. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Asaa bolla yiyaa pirdday hawaa: Poo'uu ha alamiyaa yeedda; shin asaa kiitay iita gidiyaa diraw, poo'uwaappe aatsiide, d'umaa siik'eedda. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Iitabaa ootsiyaa ooninne poo'uwaa is's'ee; ayaw gooppe, bare kiitay k'onc'c'enna mala, poo'uwaakko shiik'enna. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Shin tumuwaa ootsiyaa ooninne S'oossay azazeeddawaadan, I ootseeddawaa poo'uu k'onc'c'issana mala, poo'uwaakko shiik'ee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusinne Aa kaalliyaawanttu Yihudaa gadiyaa beeddino; Yesuusi he gadiyaan unttunttunna amareeda wodiyaa uttiide, asaa s'ammak'iidde de'ee.<verse eid="JHN 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>K'ay Yohaannisi Saaleeme mataan de'iyaa Henoona giyaa saan wogga haatsay de'iyaa diraw, Asay aakko yiina s'ammak'ee. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Hewe haneeddawe Yohaannisi k'ashettanaappe kasenna.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yohaannisa kaalliyaawanttunna amareeda Ayihudatuwaa meechchaa wogaabaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ayihudatuwaa meechchaa wogaabaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay Ayihudatuu barenttu goynaanna gatsanaw ootsiyaa dumma dumma barentta meechchaabaynne barenttu saaniyaa meec'c'iyaa wogatuu de'iyaawaa bessee.</char></note> palumetteeddino. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Unttunttu Yohaannisakko biide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, Yorddaanoosa Shaafaappe hefintsan neenanna de'iyaawe, neeni aabaa markkattowe, be'a ha"i s'ammak'ee; Asay ubbaykka aakko bee» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yohaannisi zaariide, «S'oossay immana d'ayooppe, Asay ayinne akkanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>‹Taani Kiristtoosa gidikke; shin taani aappe sintsaw kiitettaad› geeddawoo hintte hinttenttu huup'ew markka. <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Mishira mac'c'awunna de'iyaa uray ikka mishiraa; he mishiraa miyaatay ek'k'iide, I giyaawaa sisiyaawe Aa haasayaan daro nashettee. Hewaa diraw, hawe ta nashechchay poletteedda. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>I darina ta guus's'ana bessee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Bollappe yiyaawe ubbaappe bollaa. Sa'aappe beetteeddawe sa'aassa. Ikka sa'aabaa haasayee. Saluwaappe yiyaawe ubbaappe bollaa. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>I bare be'eeddabaanne siseeddabaa markkattee; shin Aa markkatetsaa akkiyaawe baawa. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Aa markkatetsaa akkiyaa ooninne S'oossay tumanchcha gidiyaawaa hewan markkattee. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>S'oossay kiitteeddawe S'oossaa k'aalaa odee; ayaw gooppe, S'oossay bare Geeshsha Ayaanaa palahissiide immee. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>S'oossay bare Na'aa siik'iide ubbabaa Aa kushiyan wotseedda. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Na'aa ammaniyaa uraw med'inaa de'uu de'ee; shin Na'aa ammanennaawaa bolla S'oossaa hank'k'uu de'anawaappe attin, I de'uwaa be'enna.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Sammaariyaa Mishiratto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1-3"/>Yesuusi Yohaannisawaappe dariyaa barena kaalliyaawantta barekko shiishsheenne s'ammak'ee giyaawaa Parisaawatuu siseeddawaa Yesuusi ereedda wode, Yihudaa aggiide, Galiilaa beedda; gidooppenne, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu s'ammak'eeddawaappe attin, Yesuusi bare huup'ew oonanne s'ammak'ibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 4:1-3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Galiilaa biidde, Sammaariyaanna aad'd'anawe Aa ashshenabaa gideedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Hewaa diraw, Yaak'oobi bare na'aa Yooseefoo immeedda gadiyaa matan de'iyaa Sikaaro geetettiyaa Sammaariyaa katamaa beedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Dom. 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya. 24:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>He sa'aan Yaak'ooba haatsaa ollay de'ee; Yesuusi hametan daaburiide, he haatsaa ollaa matan utteedda. He wode sa'ay usuppun saatiyaa heera.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Sammaariyaa mishiratta haatsaa duuk'k'anaw yeeddawunno Yesuusi, «Taana haatsaa ushshaarikkii!» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu k'umaa shammanaw katamaa beeddino.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>He Mishiratta zaaraade Aa, «Neeni Ayihuda asaa gidaadde, Sammaariyaa mac'c'a asaa gideedda taana, woota de'uwaa immiyaa haatsaa ushsha gay?» yaagaaddu; ayaw gooppe, Ayihudatoonne Sammaariyaa asaw ittipetetsay baynna diraassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Izr. 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1-2">Nah. 4:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesuusi zaariide izo, «Neeni S'oossaa imotaanne k'ay neena ‹Taana haatsaa ushsha› giyaawe oonentto eriyaawaa gidintto, Aa woossanaassa; ikka new de'uwaa immiyaa haatsaa immana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Mishiratta zaaraade, «Godaw, new duuk'k'iyaabay baawa; ollaykka c'iimmuwaa. Yaatina, de'uwaa immiyaa haatsaa hak'appe akkanii? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Nuw ha haatsaa ollaa immeedda nu aawuwaa Yaak'oobappe neeni daray? I, Aa naanaynne Aa mehii hawaappe usheeddino» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Ha haatsaappe ushiyaa ooninne laa'entsuwaa saamettanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Shin taani immiyaa haatsaa ushiyaa ooninne laa'entsuwaa saamettenna. Taani immiyaa haatsay he Aa giddon med'inaa de'uwaassi pulttiyaa pulttuwaa gidanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Mishiratta, «Godaw, taani saamettenna malanne haatsaa tikkanawukka haa yeenna mala, taw he haatsaa imma!» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesuusi izo, «Baade ne asinaa s'eesaade haa simma» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Mishiratta zaaraade, «Taw asinay baawa» yaagaaddu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesuusi, «Taw asinay baawa giyaawaan tumuwaa gaadda. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Neeni ichcheshu asinaa gelaadda; ha"i neenanna de'iyaa bitanii ne asinaa gidenna. Neeni ha"i taw odeeddawe tuma» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Mishiratta k'ay, «Godaw, neeni nabiyaa gidiyaawaa ta ha"i eraad; <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>nu Sammaariyaa asaa aawotuu ha deriyaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ha deriyaan, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giyaawe deriyaa Geerizaana gidiide Seekeema geetettiyaa katamaa matan de'iyaawaa.</char></note> goyinneeddino; shin Ayihudatuu hinttenttu Asay S'oossaw goyinnanaw bessiyaa sa'ay Yerusaalamenna yaagiita» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesuusi, «Ha mishirattee, taana ammana; ha deriyaan woy Yerusaalamen Aawuwaa S'oossaw hinttenttu goyinnenna wodii yaanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Hinttenttu Sammaariyaa Asay hintte erennabaw goyinniita; S'oossay nuuna Ayihudatuwaa go"ettiide atotetsaa ahiyaa diraw, nuuni nu eriyaawoo goyinneetto. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Shin Aawuwaa S'oossaw tumuwaappe goyinniyaawanttu Aa, Geeshsha Ayaanaa wolk'k'aaninne S'oossaa S'oossatetsaadan goyinniyaa wodii matatteedda; ubbaa ha"ikka gakkeedda. Ayaw gooppe, asaa barew goyinnana mala, Aawuu S'oossaykka ha ogiyaan goyinniyaawantta koyyee. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>S'oossay Ayaanaa; aw goyinniyaawanttukka Geeshsha Ayaanaa wolk'k'aan S'oossaa S'oossatetsaadan goyinnanaw bessee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Mishiratta, «Masihiyaa geetettiyaa Kiristtoosi yaanawaa taani eray. I yiyaa wode nuw ubbabaa odanawaa» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesuusi, «Ha neenanna haasayiyaawe taani Aa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Hawaa unttunttu haasayishshin, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu beeddasaappe simmeeddino. Yesuusi mishirattinna haasayishshin unttunttu be'iide darssi maalaletteeddino; shin mishiratto, «Ayaa koyyay?» woy Yesuusa, «Iinanna ayaw haasayay?» giide oochchowe ooninne baawa.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Mishiratta bare haatsaa otuwaa agga basha guyye katamaa baade asaw, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>«Taani ootseeddawaa ubbaa taw odeedda bitaniyaa be'anaw denddite; hewe Kiristtoosa gidaanddeeshsha?» yaagaaddu. <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Asay katamaappe kesiide, Yesuusakko beedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Hewe hanishin, Aa kaalliyaawanttu Yesuusa, «Guutsabaa maarikkii!» yaagiide woosseeddino.<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Shin I, «Taw hinttenttu erenna k'umay taani miyaawe de'ee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Hewaa diraw, Aa kaalliyaawanttu barenttu giddon, «Aw miyaabaa aheedda Asay de'anddeeshsha?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesuusi unttunttoo, «Ta k'umay taana kiitteeddawaa sheniyaa oosussaanne Aa oosuwaa polussaa. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Hinttenttu, ‹Oyddu agenaappe guyyiyaan, katsay c'akettanawaa› giikkiteeyee? Taani hinttenttoo oday; goshshaa loytsi s'eellite; katsay c'aka besseedda. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Zeriyaawenne c'akkiyaawe ittippe nashettana mala, c'akkiyaawe dirgguwaa akkeenne katsaa med'inaa de'oo shiishshee. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Ha gaasuwaan, ‹Ittuu zeree; k'ay ittuu c'akkee› giyaa haasayay tuma. <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Hinttenttu daaburibeennawaa c'akkana mala, taani hinttentta kiittaad; haratuu ootsi daabureeddino; hinttenttu haratuwaa daaburan geleeddita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Mishiratta, «I taani ootseedda ubbabaa odeedda» gaade markkatteedda diraw, he katamaan de'iyaa Sammaariyaa asaappe c'oray Yesuusa ammaneedda. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Sammaariyaa Asay Yesuusakko yeedda wode, barenttu mataan gam"ana mala, Yesuusa woossina I yaan laa"u gallassaa utteedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>I odiyaa k'aalaa diraw, kasewaappe c'ora Asay ammaneedda; <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>k'ay unttunttu mishiratto, «Nuuni nu huup'ew I giyaawaa sisiide ammaneeddawaappe attin, neeni markkatteedda diraassa gidenna; I tumu alamiyaa asaa ashshiyaawaa gidiyaawaakka nuuni ereeddo» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Itti Kaappuwaa Na'aa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Laa"u gallassaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi Sammaariyaappe kesiide, Galiilaa gadiyaa beedda. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Ayaw gooppe, I bare huup'ew, «Nabii bare gadiyaan bonchchettenna» yaagi odeedda. <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Yesuusi Galiilaa gakkeedda wode, Galiilaa Asay Aa mokkeedda; Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassi unttunttu Yerusaalamen de'iyaa diraw, I ootseedda ubbabaa be'eeddino.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Yesuusi haatsaa woyniyaa ushshaa kesseedda, Galiilaan de'iyaa K'aanaa katamaa beedda. K'ifirinaahooman Aa na'ay sakettiyaa, kaatiyaa gollen ootsiyaa itti kaappuu de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Yesuusi Yihudaappe Galiilaa yeeddawaa he kaappuu sisiide, aakko yiide hayk'k'anaw mateedda bare na'aa biide patsana mala, Yesuusa woosseedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesuusi he kaappuwaa, «S'oossay ootsiyaa malaataanne hechcho giissiyaabaa be'ennaan de'iidde, hinttenttu ayinne ammanikkita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>He kaappuu zaariide, «Godaw, ta na'ay hayk'k'ennan de'ishshin, taananna baarikkii» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesuusi, «Ba; ne na'ay pas'a de'anawaa!» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">He kaappuu Yesuusi geeddawaa ammaniide beedda. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>I bare golle biishshin, Aa k'oomatuu aanana ogiyaan gakettiide Aa, «Ne na'ay pas'a de'ee» geeddino.<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>I bare k'oomatuwaa bare na'aw ay saatiyaan keekeeddentto oochchina unttunttu, «Zino laappu saatiyaan k'oos'uu Aa aggeedda» yaageeddino. <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Na'aa aawuu Yesuusi barew, «Ne na'ay pas'a de'anawaa» geeddawe he saatiyaanna gideeddawaa hassayeedda. Hewaa diraw, inne Aa soy Asay ubbay ammaneeddino.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Hawe Yesuusi Yihudaappe Galiilaa yiide ootseedda laa'entso malaataa.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Gundda Bitaniyaa Dagatti <optbreak/>Utteedda Haatsaa Mataan Patseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi Ayihudatuu bonchchiyaa baalaw Yerusaalame beedda. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Yerusaalamen dorssaa penggiyaa matan Ibraayiss's'e k'aalaan Beetesayda geetettiyaa dagatti utteedda haatsay de'ee; he dagatti utteedda haatsaa yuuyyi aad'd'eedda ichcheshu kashay de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Hewaan c'ora hargganchchatuu, k'ook'atuu, wobbatuunne sileeddawanttu giseeddino. [Haatsay k'aas's'iyaawaa naagiino. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Ayaw gooppe, itti itti gede Godaa kiitanchchay he dagatteedda haatsaakko geliide, haatsaa k'aatsee; haatsay k'aas's'eeddawaappe guyyiyaan, koyro geleedda uray barena oyk'k'eedda ay harggiyaappekka pas'ee.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha payduu itti beni koyrottiide s'aafetteedda Geeshsha Mas'aafatuwan baawa.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Hewaan hattamanne hosppun laytsaa saketteedda itti bitanii de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>He bitanii hewan giseeddawaa Yesuusi be'iide, daro wodiyaa saketteeddawaakka eriide bitaniyaa, «Pas'anaw koyyay?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Sakettiyaa bitanii zaariide, «Godaw, haatsay k'aas's'iyaa wode, taana haatsaan yeggiyaa Asay d'ayeedda; taani gelana haniyaa wode, hara uray taappe kasetiide geli aggee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesuusi Aa, «Dendda ek'k'a; neeni gisowaa tookkaade ba» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Bitanii ellekka pas'i aggeedda; bare gisuwaa tookkiide beedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Hewe haneeddawe Sambbata gallassaana. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Hewaa diraw, Ayihudatuu pas'eedda bitaniyaa, «Hachche sa'ay Sambbataa; neeni ne gisuwaa tookka biyaawe woga gidenna» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Nah. 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Erm. 17:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Shin bitanii, «Taana patseeddawe, ‹Ne gisuwaa tookkaade ba› yaageedda» giide unttunttoo zaareedda.<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Unttunttu Aa, «Neena, ‹Ne gisuwaa tookkaade ba› geeddawe I oonee?» giide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Shin hewaan c'ora Asay de'iyaa dirawunne, Yesuusikka geemetteedda diraw, bitanii barena patseeddawe oonentto erenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Yesuusi guyyeppe he bitaniyaa Geeshsha Golliyaan demmiide, «Be'a, neeni ha"i pas'aadda; hawaappekka iitabay neena gakkenna mala, laa'entso nagaraa ootsoppa» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, bitanii biide, barena patseeddawe Yesuusa gidiyaawaa Ayihuda asaa kaappatoo odeedda.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Yesuusi hawaa Sambbataan ootseedda diraw, unttunttu Yesuusa yedesaan waayissuwaa doommeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Yesuusi zaariide unttunttoo, «Ta Aabbu ubbaa wode ootsee; taanikka ootsanaw bessee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Hewaa diraw, Yesuusi Sambbata gallassaa bonchchenna diraa s'alalaassa gidennaan, barena S'oossaanna k'arayiide, «S'oossay ta Aabba» geedda diraw, Ayihuda asaa kaappatuu Aa wod'anaw kasewaappe minisiide koyyiino.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'oossaa Na'aa Maataa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Yesuusi zaariide unttunttoo, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; Na'ay barekka ayinne ootsenna. I bare Aabbu ootsishshin be'iyaawaa s'alalaa ootsee; Aawuu ootsiyaawaa Na'aykka ootsee. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Ayaw gooppe, Aawuu bare Na'aa siik'ee; k'ay I ootsiyaa oosuwaa ubbabaa bare Na'aa bessee. Ubbaa hinttenttu maalalettana gakkanaw, I hawaappe aad'd'iyaa oosuwaakka bare Na'aa bessanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Gaasuunnee, Aawuu hayk'k'eeddawantta hayk'uwaappe dentsiide shemppuwaanna wotsiyaawaadan, Na'aykka k'ay bare koyyowantta shemppuwaanna wotsee. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22-23"/>Asay ubbay Aawuwaa bonchchiyaawaadan, Na'aakka bonchchana mala, Aawuu pirddaa ubbaa Na'aw immeeddawaappe attin, I oonanne pirddenna; Na'aa bonchchenna uray, Aa kiitteedda Aawuwaakka bonchchenna.<verse eid="JHN 5:22-23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>«Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; ta k'aalaa sisiyaawoonne taana kiitteeddawaan ammaniyaawoo med'inaa de'uu de'ee. Hayk'uwaappe de'oo I pinneeddawaappe attin, pirddettenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; hayk'k'eedda Asay S'oossaa Na'aa kooshshaa sisiyaa wodii yaanawaa; hewenneekka ha"a. He kooshshaa sisiyaawanttu shemppuwaanna de'ana. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Ayaw gooppe, Aawoo de'uwaa immiyaa wolk'k'ay de'iyaawaadan, de'uwaa immiyaa he wolk'k'aa bare Na'awukka immeedda. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>S'oossaa Aawuu bare Na'aw pirddiyaa maataa immeedda; ayaw gooppe, Na'ay Asaa Na'aa.<verse eid="JHN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>«Hawaan malalettoppite; ayaw gooppe, duufuwaan de'iyaawanttu Aa kooshshaa sisiyaa wodii yee. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Sisiide unttunttu duufuwaappe gas'aa kesana; lo"obaa ootseeddawanttu de'uwaan de'anaw denddana; k'ay iitabaa ootseeddaawanttu pirddettanaw denddanawantta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan. 12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusaw Markkatteedda Asatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>«Taani taappe ayinne ootsanaw danddaykke; S'oossay taw odeeddawaadan pirdday. Ta pirdday tuma; ayaw gooppe, taani taana kiitteeddawaa sheniyaa poliyaawaappe attin, taani dosiyaawaa ootsikke.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>«Taani ta huup'ew tabaa markkattooppe, ta markkatetsay tuma gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Tabaa markkattiyaawe haray de'ee; I tabaa markkattiyaawe tuma gidiyaawaa taani eray.<verse eid="JHN 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>«Hinttenttu Yohaannisakko asaa kiittina, I unttunttoo tumuwaa markkatteedda. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Taani hewaa hinttentta attino gaade giyaawaappe attin, asaa markkatetsay taw koshshina gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yohaannisi muk'aaddaadan, ees's'eeddanne poo'isseedda; hinttenttukka amareeda wodiyaa Aa poo'uwaan nashettanaw koyyeeddita.<verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>«Shin taw Yohaannisawaappe aad'd'iyaa markkatetsay de'ee; ayaw gooppe, taani wurssanaw Ta Aabbu taw immeedda kiitay, ha taani ootsiyaawe, I taana kiitteeddawaa gidiyaawaa markkattee.<verse eid="JHN 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>«K'ay taana kiitteedda Ta Aabbu bare huup'ew tabaa markkattee. Hinttenttu Aa kooshshaa ayinne sisibeykkita; Aa malaakka be'ibeykkita. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>I kiitteeddawaa ammanenna diraw, Aa k'aalay hinttenttu wozanaan baawa.<verse eid="JHN 5:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>«S'oossaa Mas'aafatuwaappe med'inaa de'uwaa demmiyaawaa hinttew malatina, unttuntta biddiita; unttunttukka tabaa markkattiyaawantta. <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Shin de'uwaa demmanaw taakko yiyaawaa hinttenttu koyyikkita.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>«Taani asaappe bonchchuwaa koyyikke. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Shin taani hinttenttu wozanaan S'oossaa siik'uu baynnawaa eray. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Taani ta Aabbu suntsan yaad; shin taana akkibeykkita. Shin hara Asay bare suntsan yiyaa wode, Aa akkiita. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Hinttenttu ittuu ittuwaa bonchchiita; shin itti S'oossaappe yiyaa bonchchuwaa koyyikkita. Yaatina, waaniide ammananaw danddayiite?<verse eid="JHN 5:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>«Taani Ta Aabbu sintsan hinttentta mootiyaawaa hinttew malatoppo; hinttentta mootiyaawe, hintte hidootaa wotsiyaa Musa. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Hinttenttu Musa ammaneeddabaa gidintto, taanakka ammananita; ayaw gooppe, tabaa s'aafeeddawe Aa. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Shin hinttenttu I s'aafeeddawaa ammanennaan is's'ooppe, taani giyaawaa wooti ammananitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi 5,000 Asaa Mizeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk'. 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi Galiilaa Abbaappe woy S'ibiriyaadoosa Abbaappe hefintsa pinneedda. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>I hargganchchatuwaa bolla ootseedda wolk'k'aama malaataa be'eedda diraw, c'ora Asay Aa kaalleedda. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yesuusi deriyaa kesiide, yaan barena kaalliyaawanttunna ittippe utteedda. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Ayihudatuu bonchchiyaa Paasigaa gallassay gakkeedda. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yesuusi sintsakko s'eelliide, c'ora Asay barekko yiyaawaa be'iide Pilip'p'oosa, «Ha asaa ubbaa mizanaw gidiyaa k'umaa hak'appe shammanee?» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>I hewaa Pilip'p'oosa paac'c'anaw geedda; ayaw gooppe, I bare huup'ew ayaa ootsana bessintto ootsanabaa eree.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Pilip'p'oosi zaariide Yesuusa, «Huup'iyaan huup'iyaan, haray atto itti itti barssuwaa gatsanaw, laa"u s'eetu dinaariyaan shammeedda ukitsaykka gidenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>K'ay Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu, Simooni P'es'iroosa ishay Inddiraasi, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>«Banggaa ukitsaa ichcheshuunne laa"u molii de'iyaa itti na'ay hawaan de'ee; shin ha asaa ubbaw hewe wooti gidanee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta, «Asay uttanaadan ootsite» yaageedda. He sa'aan daro maatay de'ee. Asay ubbay utteedda; attuma Asay ichcheshu sha"aa gidiyaawaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yesuusi ukitsaa akkeedda; S'oossaa galatiide, hewan utteedda asaw gisheedda. Moliyaakka hewaadan ootsina Asay bare koyyeeddawaa keenaa meedda. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Unttunttu ubbay kalleeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta «Ittibaykka c'oo bayenna mala, atteedda dokkaa shiishshite» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Hewaa diraw, unttunttu ubbaakka shiishsheeddino; Asay kallina atteedda banggaa ukitsaa dokkaa shiishshiide, tammanne laa"u zambbeeliyaa kuntseeddino.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Asay Yesuusi ootseedda wolk'k'aama malaataa be'eedda wode, «Hawe tumuwaappe ha sa'aa yaana geedda nabiyaa» yaageeddino. <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Unttunttu yiide barena wolk'k'an oyk'k'i kaatiyaa ootsanaw haniyaawaa Yesuusi eriide, barekka deriyaa bolla shirettiide keseedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Abbaa Bollan Hamettiidde Beedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar. 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Sa'ay omarsseedda wode, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu abbaakko beeddino; <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Sa'ay k'ammeedda; shin Yesuusi unttunttukko he saatii gakkanaw yibeenna; hewoo unttunttu wonggiriyaan geliide, abbaa pinni hefintsa K'ifirinaahooma beeddino. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Wolk'k'aama c'arkkuu c'arkkeedda diraw, abbay k'aas's'eedda; <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>itti saatiyaa keenaa unttunttu abbaa shaagowaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi abbaa bollanna hamettiidde yiyaawaa be'iide yayyeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Shin I, «Yayyoppite; taanattee!» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Unttunttu wonggiriyaan Aa gelissanaw koyyeeddino; wonggirii unttunttu biyaasaa abbaa gas'aa ellekka gakki aggeedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi De'uwaa Ukitsaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Wonttetsa gallassi, abbaappe hefintsanna atteedda c'ora Asay abbaa bolla itti wonggiriyaa s'alalay de'iyaawaa be'eeddino; Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttunna wonggiriyaan geliide, unttunttunna beennaan, unttunttu barekka beeddawaa akeekeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Shin S'ibiriyaadoosappe hara wonggiratuu Yesuusi S'oossaa galatina, Asay ukitsaa meeddasaa mataa yeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Asay Yesuusi woy Aa kaalliyaawanttu hewaan baynnawaa be'iide, Yesuusa koyyanaw wonggiriyaan geliide, K'ifirinaahooma beeddino.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Asay Yesuusa abbaappe hefintsan demmeedda wode, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, hawaa awude yaaddii?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; hinttenttu taana koyyiyaawe ukitsaa meedda diraassanne kalleedda diraassa gidiyaawaappe attin, wolk'k'aama malaataa be'eedda diraassa gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Med'inaa de'uwaa k'umaw, taani Asaa Na'ay hinttenttoo immanawoo, ootsiteppe attin, samiyaa k'umaw ootsoppite; ayaw gooppe, Aawuu S'oossay hewaa d'iishissanaw maatafaa attami wotseedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan unttunttu, «Nuuni S'oossaa oosuwaa ootsanaw ayaa ootsanaw bessii?» yaagiide Yesuusa oochcheeddino.<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Hinttenttu ootsana mala, S'oossay koyyiyaa kiitay hawaa; I kiitteeddawaan ammanite» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Unttunttu zaariide, «Nuuni be'iide, neenan ammanana mala, ay wolk'k'aama malaataa ootsanii? Ayaa kiitettanii? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>S'oossaa mas'aafaan, ‹Unttunttu mannaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mannaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israa'eeliyaa Asay Gibs'e gadiyaappe kesi Kanaane biidde mela biittaan hamettiidde biyaa wode, unttunttu maanaadan S'oossay immeedda mal"iyaa k'umaa. Mannaa guussay Ibraayiss's'iyaa k'aalaan «Hawe ayee?» giyaawaa.</char></note> mala saluwaappe ukitsaa immeedda› yaagetti s'aafettowaadan, nu aawotuu mela biittaan mannaa meeddino» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Kes. 16:4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Maz. 78:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesuusi, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; hinttenttoo saluwaappe tumu ukitsaa immiyaawe ta Aabbappe attin, hinttenttoo saluwaappe ukitsaa immeeddawe Musa gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Ayaw gooppe, tuma gideedda S'oossaa ukitsay, saluwaappe wod'd'iyaawe ha alamiyaa asaw de'uwaa immee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Unttunttu zaariide, «Godaw, nukka he ukitsaa ubbaa wode imma» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesuusi, «Taani de'uwaa ukitsaa; taakko yiyaa uray ubbakka koshattenna. K'ay taana ammaniyaa uray ayinne saamettenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Shin taani hinttenttoo odeeddawaadan, hinttenttu taana be'eeddita; shin ammanikkita. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Ta Aabbu taw immiyaa ubbay taakko yaanawaa; k'ay taakko yiyaa oonanne ubbakka taani kare yeddikke. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Ayaw gooppe, taani taana kiitteeddawaa sheniyaa polanaw saluwaappe yaaddippe attin, ta sheniyaa polanaw yabeykke. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Taana kiitteeddawe koyyiyaawe hawaa; taani I taw immeedda ubbatuwaakka wurssetsaa gallassi dentsanaappe attin, ittuwaakka bayizzana mala koyyenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Ayaw gooppe, ta Aabbu koyyiyaawe hawaa; taana Na'aa be'iide, ammaniyaa ubbatuu med'inaa de'uwaa akkanawantta; taanikka he ubbatuwaa wurssetsaa gallassi dentsana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Yesuusi, «Taani saluwaappe wod'd'eedda ukitsaa» geedda diraw, Ayihudatuu Aa bolla zuuzummeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Unttunttu, «Hawe nuuni Aa aawuwaanne Aa aatto eriyaa Yooseefo na'aa Yesuusa gidennee? Yaatina, I waagiide, ‹Taani saluwaappe wod'd'aaddi› gaanaw danddayii?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Ittuu ittuwaanna zuuzummiyaawaa aggite. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Taana kiitteedda ta Aabbu taakko aheedda asaappe attin, taakko yaanaw danddayiyaa Asay baawa; taanikka wurssetsaa gallassi Aa dentsana. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Nabatuu ‹S'oossay asaa ubbaa tamaarissana› yaagiide s'aafeeddino; Aawuu giyaawaa sisiyaawenne Aawuwaappe tamaariyaawe ooninne taakko yee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa. 54:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>S'oossaa matappe yeeddawaappe attin, S'oossaa be'eedda Asay baawa; Aa s'alalay S'oossaa be'eedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>«Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; taana ammaniyaa uraw med'inaa de'uu de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Taani de'uwaa ukitsaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Hinttenttu aawotuu mela biittaan mannaa meeddino; shin hayk'k'eeddino. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Asay aappe miide hayk'k'enna ukitsay saluwaappe yiyaawe hawaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Saluwaappe wod'd'eedda de'uwaa ukitsay taana; ooninne ha Ukitsaappe mooppe, med'inaw de'anawaa; k'ay ha alamiyaa asaw de'o gidana mala, taani immana ukitsay ta ashuwaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Ayihudatuu, «Ha bitanii bare ashuwaa nuuni maana mala, nuw wootiide immanaw danddayii?» yaagiide barenttu gidduwaan palumetteeddino.<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Hewaa diraw, Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; ta ashuwaa, Asaa Na'aa ashuwaa, hinttenttu maana d'ayooppe, k'ay ta suutsaakka ushana d'ayooppe, hinttew de'uu baawa. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Ta ashuwaa miyaa urawunne, ta suutsaa ushiyaa uraw med'inaa de'uu de'ee. Taani wurssetsa gallassi unttuntta dentsana. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Ayaw gooppe, ta ashuu tumu k'umaa; ta suutsaykka tumu ushshaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Ta ashuwaa miyaa uraynne ta suutsaa ushiyaa uray taanan de'ee; taanikka aanani de'ay. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>De'uwaa Aawuu taana kiittina, taani Aa gaasuwaan de'iyaawaadan, taana miyaa uraykka ta gaasuwaan de'ana. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Saluwaappe wod'd'eedda ukitsay hawaa; hinttenttu aawotuu miide hayk'k'eedda mannaa mala gidenna; ha ukitsaa miyaa uray med'inaw de'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Yesuusi K'ifirinaahooma katamaan Ayihuda woosa gollen tamaarissiidde, hawaa odeedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Med'inaa De'uwaa K'aalaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe dariyaa baggay hewaa siseedda wode, «Hawe gelenna timirttiyaa; hawaa ooni akkanawee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Shin Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttu hewoo zuuzummeeddawaa eriide, «Hawe hinttentta d'ubbii? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Simmi taani, Asaa Na'ay, kase de'iyaasaa pude kesishshin be'intto ayaa gaanitee? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Geeshsha Ayyaanay de'uwaa immee; asaa minotay ayinne go"enna. Taani hinttenttoo odeedda k'aalay ayyaanaanne de'uwaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Shin hinttenttu gidduwaan ammanennawanttu de'iino» yaageedda; ayaw gooppe, ammanennawanttu hak'awanttenttonne barena aatsi immanawe oonentto Yesuusi koyroppe doommiide ereedda. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>K'aykka Yesuusi, «Ta Aabbuppe gidana d'ayooppe ooninne taakko yaanaw danddayenna yaagaade ta odeeddawe hewaa diraassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Hewaa gaasuwaan, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe c'oratuu Aa aggiide, guyye simmeeddino; laa'entso Aa kaallibeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Yesuusi k'ay tammanne laa"u barena kaalliyaawantta «Hinttekka aggiide baanaw koyyiitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simooni P'es'iroose zaariide, «Godaw, nuuni ookko baanee? New med'inaa de'uwaa k'aalay de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Neeni S'oossaa Geeshsha gidiyaawaa nuuni ammaneettonne ereetto» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taani hinttentta tammanne laa"atuwaa doorabeykkitaa? K'ay hintteppe ittuu s'alahiyaa» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Yesuusi hewaa Simoona na'aa Yihudaa Ask'k'oroota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:71 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ask'k'oroota: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha k'aalaa biletsay, «Woretiyaa bitaniyaa» woy «Hayk'oo aatsi immiyaa bitaniyaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> gee; ayaw gooppe, Yihuday Yesuusa kaalliyaa tammanne laa"atuwaappe ittuwaa; I Yesuusa aatsi immanawaa.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Daasiyaa Baalaw Yerusaalame Beedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Hewaappe guyye, Yesuusi Galiilaan yaa haa yuuyyeedda; Ayihudatuu Aa wod'anaw koyyiyaa diraw, Yihudaan yuuyyana koyyibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Ayihudatuu bonchchiyaa Daasiyaa Baalay gakki utteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Wog. 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Zar. 16:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Hewaa diraw, Yesuusa ishatuu Aa, «Neena kaalliyaawanttu neeni ootsiyaawaa be'ana mala, hawaappe denddaade Yihudaa gadiyaa ba. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Ayaw gooppe, barew erettanaw koyyiyaa Asay ooninne bare oosuwaa gentsenna. Neeni hawantta ootsina, nebaa alamiyaa ubbay ero!» yaageeddino. <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Ayaw gooppe, haray atto Aa ishatuukka Aa ammanibeykkino.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taw injjetiyaa wodii gakkibeenna; shin hinttenttoo ay wodekka injjetee. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Alamii hinttentta is's'anaw danddayenna; shin taani sa'aa kiittay iita gidiyaawaa markkattiyaa diraw, taana is's'eedda. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Baalaa bonchchiyaasaa hinttenttu biite; taw injjetiyaa wodii gakkibeenna diraw, taani baalaa bonchchiyaasaa baanawe biraa» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>I hawaa giide, Galiilaan atteedda.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Daasiyaa Baalaasan Beetteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Shin Aa ishatuu baalaa gallassaa bonchchiyaasaa beeddawaappe guyyiyaan, ikka Asay be'ennaan geeman yaa beedda. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Ayihudatuu baalaa gallassaa bonchchiyaasan Aa koyyiinonne, «I hak'an de'ii?» yaagiidde, Aa labiino.<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Asaa gidduwaan daro zuuzuntsay denddeedda. Amareeda asay, «I lo"o asaa» yaagee; haratuu k'ay, «Aa, I asaa baletsee» yaagiino. <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Shin Ayihudatuu yayyeedda diraw, ooninne aabaa k'onc'c'iyaan haasayenna.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Baalaa bonchchiyaa gallassaa baggan, Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaa biide, tamaarissuwaa doommeedda. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Ayihudatuu maalalettiide, «Ha bitanii ayinne tamaarennaan hawaa keena waan ereeddee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Hewaa diraw, Yesuusi zaariide, «Taana tamaarissiyaawe taana kiitteedda S'oossaa matappe yiyaawaappe attin, tawaa gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>S'oossaa sheniyaa ootsanaw dosiyaa ooninne ha taani tamaarissiyaawe S'oossaa matappe yintto woy k'ay taani taappe haasayayitantto erana. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Barewaa haasayiyaa uray bare huup'iyaw bonchchuwaa koyyee; shin barena kiitteeddawe bonchchettana mala koyyiyaa uray tumanchchaa; aan worddobay baawa. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Muse hinttenttoo higgiyaa immibeennee? Shin hintteppe ittuunne higgiyaa naagenna. Taana ayaw wod'anaw koyyiitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Asay zaariide, «Neenan s'alahii de'ee; neena wod'anaw oonee koyyeeddawe?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesuusi, «Taani itti wolk'k'aamabaa ootsina, hinttenttu ubbay maalaletteeddita. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Hinttenttu naanaa hinttenttu dookaalana mala, Muse hinttentta azazeedda. Shin dookaalussay hinttenttu aawotuwaana yeeddawaappe attin, Musenna yibeenna; hewoo hinttenttu Sambbataan attuma naanaa dookaaliita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Dom. 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Wog. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Muse higgii azazeedda diraw, hinttenttu Sambbataan dookaaliyaawaa gidooppe, yaatina taani itti asaw kumentsaa bollaa patseedda diraw, taana ayaw hank'k'ettiitee? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Tumu pirddaa pirdditeppe attin, asaa deemuwaa s'eelliide pirddoppite» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hawe Kiristtoosee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Hewaa diraw, Yerusaalame asaappe ittuu ittuu, «Unttunttu wod'anaw koyyiyaa bitanii hawaa gidennee? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Be'ite, k'onc'c'iyaan I haasayee; unttunttu Aa ayinne giikkino. Hawe Kiristtoosa gidiyaawaa nu kaappatuu tumu eriinooshsha? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Shin nuuni Aa hak'appe yeeddentto eroytte; Kiristtoosi yiyaa wode, I hak'appe yinttonne ooninne erenna» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaan tamaarissiidde, bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Hinttenttu taana eriita; k'ay taani hak'appe yeeddenttokka eriita. Taani ta sheniyaan yabeykke; shin taana kiitteeddawe tumanchchaa; hinttenttu Aa erikkita. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Shin taani Aa eray; ayaw gooppe, I taana kiittina, taani Aa matappe yaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Hewaa diraw, unttunttu Aa oyk'k'anaw koyyeeddino; shin Aa wodii biro gakkibeenna diraw, ooninne Aa bolla kushiyaa wotsibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Shin daro Asay Yesuusa ammaniide, «Kiristtoosi yiyaa wode, ha bitanii ootseedda malaataappe dariyaawaa ootsaneeyee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Oyk'k'anaw Wotaadaratuu Kiitetteeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Parisaawatuu daro Asay Yesuusabaa zuuzummiyaawaa siseeddino; k'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne Parisaawatuu Aa oyk'k'i k'ashissanaw amareeda wotaadaratuwaa kiitteeddino.<verse eid="JHN 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesuusi, «Taani hinttenanna laafaa gam"ana; hewaappe guyyiyaan, taana kiitteeddawaakko baana. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Hinttenttu taana koyyana; shin demmikkita; ayaw gooppe, taani de'iyaa sa'aa hinttenttu baanaw danddaykkita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Ayihudatuu ittuu ittuwaanna, «Hawe nuuni Aa demmennassaa hak'a baana hanii? Ayihudatuu de'iyaa Giriike katamaa biide, Giriike asatuwaa tamaarissana hanii? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>I, ‹Hintte taana koyyana; shin demmikkita› k'ay, ‹Taani de'iyaasaa hinttenttu baanaw danddaykkita› yaagee; hewaa giyaawe waagiyaawee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">De'uwaa Immiyaa Haatsaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>He baalaa gallassaa bonchchiyaa gallassaappe waannatiyaa wurssetsa gallassaan Yesuusi denddi ek'k'iide, bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Saametteedda uray ooninne taakko yiide usho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Wog. 23:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Taanan ammaniyaawoo, S'oossaa Mas'aafay giyaawaadan, Aa uluwaappe de'uwaa immiyaa haatsaa pulttuu gogganawaa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hiz. 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zak. 14:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>I hewaa Aa ammaneeddawanttu akkana Geeshsha Ayaanaabaa haasayeedda. Yesuusi biro bare bonchchuwaakko kesibeenna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yesuusi biro bare bonchchuwaakko kesibeenna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yohaannisa mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaan, Yesuusaw kumentsaa bonchchuu imetteeddawe, I mask'k'aliyaa bollan kak'etteedda wodenne bare Aabbu ushechcha baggan uttanaw hayk'uwaa s'ooniide denddeedda wodiyaanna gidiyaawaa k'onc'c'issee.</char></note> diraw, he wode Geeshsha Ayyaanay unttunttoo imettibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asaa Giddon Med'etteedda P'alk'k'etsaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>He asaappe dariyaa baggay I giyaawaa sisiide, «Tumu hawe naagettiyaa Nabiyaa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Haranttu, «Hawe Kiristtoosa» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Shin haranttu k'ay, «Kiristtoosi Galiilaappe yeenna. <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>S'oossaa Mas'aafay, ‹Kiristtoosi Daawite zariyaappe, Daawite de'eedda Beeteleeme katamaappe yaana› geenneyee?» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam. 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik. 5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Yesuusa gaasuwaan Asay bare gidduwaan shaaketteedda. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>He asaappe ittuu ittuu Aa oyk'k'anaw koyyeeddino; shin kushiyaaninne Aa bochchibeykkino.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Geeshsha Golliyaa naagiyaawanttu k'eesatuwaa kaappatuwaakkonne Parisaawatuwaakko simmi yeedda wode unttunttu naagiyaawantta, «Ayaw Aa ahibeykkitee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Geeshsha Golliyaa naagiyaawanttu unttunttoo, «Ha bitanii haasayeeddawaadan, ubbakka ooninne haasayibeenna!» yaagiide zaareeddino.<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Parisaawatuu zaariide, «I hinttenakka baletsuwaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Kaappatuwaappe woy Parisaawatuwaappe Aa ammaneedda Asay de'ii? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Shin higgiyaa erenna ha Asay shek'etteeddawaa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Unttunttuppe ittuu kasenna Yesuusakko beedda Nik'oodimoosi unttuntta, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>«Itti uray giyaabaa sisennaan woy I ayaa ootseeddentto erennaan de'iidde, kasetiide Aa bolla pirddiyaawe nu higgiyan de'ii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Unttunttu zaariide Aa, «Neenikka k'ay Galiilaa gadiyaa asee? Galiilaa gadiyaappe Nabii beettenawaa S'oossaa Mas'aafatuwaa biddaade era» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woshummaadde Oyk'etteedda Mishiratto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Asay ubbay aggiide, bare soy bare soy beedda.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Shin Yesuusi Wogaraa Mitsaan eretteedda Deriyaakko beedda. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Wonttetsa gallassi guuran Geeshsha Golliyaa simmeedda; ubbaa Asay aakko yiina, uttiide unttuntta tamaarissuwaa doommeedda. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttunne Parisaawatuu woshummishshin oyk'etteedda itti mishiratto aakko aheeddino. Unttunttu asaa ubbaa sintsan izo essiide Yesuusa, <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>«Tamaarissiyaawoo, ha mishiratta woshummaadde oyk'ettaaddu. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Higgiyaa bollan Muse hanni mala mac'c'a asaa shuchchaan c'addana mala, nuuna azazeedda. Yaatina neeni waagay?» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Wog. 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Zar. 22:22-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Unttunttu hewaa geeddawe Yesuusa mootiyaawaa demmiide Aa paac'c'anaassa; shin Yesuusi hokkiide, bare birad'd'iyan biittaa bolla s'aafeedda. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Unttunttu Aa oochchiide aggenaan is's'ina, pude d'ok'k'u giide, «Hinttenttu gidduwaan nagaraa ootsibeenna Asay kasetiide, izo shuchchaan c'addo» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>K'aykka hokkiide, biittaa bolla s'aafeedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Unttunttu hewaa siseedda wode, kasetiide c'imatuu kesina, ittuu ittuu kesiidde wureeddino; Aa sintsaan mishiratta ek'k'a de'ishshin, Yesuusi bare s'alalaa atteedda. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>I pude d'ok'k'u giide mishiratto, «Mishirattee, asatuu hak'an de'iino? Ooninne ne bolla pirddibeennee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Mishiratta, «Godaw, ooninne ta bolla pirddibeenna» yaagaaddu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesuusi izo, «Taanikka ne bolla pirddikke; ba; laa'entsaade nagaraa ootsoppa» yaageedda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:53-8:11">7:53—8:11</ref> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itti itti beni s'aafetteedda Geeshsha Mas'aafatuwan ha payduu baawa.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>K'aykka Yesuusi asaw, «Taani alamew poo'uwaa; Taana kaalliyaa ooninne de'uwaa immiyaa poo'uwaa demmanaappe attin, d'umaan ubbaakka hamettenna» yaagiide haasayeedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Hewaappe guyye Parisaawatuu, «Neeni nebaa markkattaasa; ne markkatetsay tuma gidenna» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Taani Tabaa markkattooppekka, Ta markkatetsay tuma; ayaw gooppe, Taani hak'appe yaadditanttonne k'ay hak'a baytantto eray; shin hinttenttu erikkita. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Asay pirddiyaa ogiyaan hinttenttu pirddiita; Taani itti uraa bollaakka pirddikke. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Shin Taani pirddiyaawaa gidooppenne, Ta pirdday tuma; ayaw gooppe, Taana kiitteedda Ta Aabbu Taananna de'eeppe attin, Taani Taarekka de'ikke. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Laa"u asaa markkatetsay tuma gidiyaawe hinttenttu higgiyaan s'aafetti utteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Zar. 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Taani Tabaa Ta huup'ew markkattaaddi; k'ay Taana kiitteedda Ta Aabbukka Tabaa markkattee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Unttunttu, «Ne aabbu hak'an de'ii?» yaagiide Yesuusa oochcheeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesuusi zaariide, «Hinttenttu Taanakka woy Ta Aabbakka erikkita; Taana ereeddawaa gidintto, Ta Aabbakka eranita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaa tamaarissiidde, imotaa miishshay uttiyaa saas'iniyaa matan hewaa haasayeedda. Aa ooninne oyk'k'ibeenna; ayaw gooppe, Aa wodii biro gakkibenna.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ammanennaan Is's'eeddawanttoo Imetteedda Mino Akeekissuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>K'aykka Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taani baana hinttenttu Taana koyyana; shin hinttenttu, hinttenttu nagaraan hayk'k'anita. Taani biyaasaakka baanaw hinttenttu danddaykkita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Ayihudatuu, «I, ‹Taani biyaasaa hinttenttu baanaw danddaykkita› yaagee; I barena barekka wod'aneeyye?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Hinttenttu garssa asaa; Taani bolla asaa. Hinttenttu ha alamiyaa asaa; Taani ha alamiyaa asaa gidikke. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Hinttenttu, hinttenttu nagaraan hayk'k'anawaa Taani hinttenttoo odeeddawe hawaassa; Taani Taana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Taani Taana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihude asaw wolk'k'aamanne geeshsha gideedda S'oossaa suntsay «Yahiweh» gidiide, hawaa biletsaykka Taani Taana giyaawaa.</char></note> gidiyaawaa hinttenttu ammanana d'ayooppe, hinttenttu, hinttenttu nagaraan hayyanita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Unttunttu, «Neeni oonee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesuusi zaariide, «Taani Taana. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Taani hinttebaa haasayiyaabaynne pirddiyaabay darobay de'ee. Shin Taana kiitteeddawe tumanchchaa; k'ay Taani aappe siseeddawaa alamiyaa asaw oday» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>I bare Aawuwabaa haasayiyaawaa unttunttu akeekibeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Hewaa diraw, Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taana Asaa Na'aa hinttenttu mask'k'aliyaa bolla pude dentsiyaa wode, Taani Taana gidiyaawaanne k'ay Taani Ta Aabbu Taana tamaarisseeddawaadan haasayiyaawaappe attin, Ta sheniyaan ayinne ootsennawaa hinttenttu eranita. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>K'ay taana kiitteeddawe Taananna de'ee; Taani ubbaa wode Aa nashechchiyaawaa ootsiyaa diraw, I Ta s'alalaa aggibeenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Yesuusi hewaa haasayishshin siseedda daro Asay Aa ammaneeddino.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nagaraa Ayiletetsaappe La"a Kessaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Yesuusi barena ammaneedda Ayihudatuwaa, «Hinttenttu Taani tamaarissiyaawoo azazettooppe, tumu Taana kaalliyaawantta. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Hinttenttu tumatetsaakka eranita; k'ay tumatetsay hinttentta ayiletetsaappe kessanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Unttunttu zaariide, «Nuuni Abraahaamo zare; nuuni oossinnekka ayiletibeykko. Yaatina neeni waagaade, ‹Ayiletetsaappe hinttenttu kesanita› gay?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesuusi, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; nagaraa ootsiyaa ooninne nagaraa ayiliyaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Ayilii ubbaa wode soyin de'enna; shin na'ay med'inaw gollen de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Na'ay hinttentta ayiletetsaappe kesooppe, hinttenttu ayiletetsaappe tumu kessanita. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Hinttenttu Abraahaamo zare gidiyaawaa Taani eray; shin Ta tamaarissiyaawaa hinttenttu akkena diraw, Taana wod'anaw koyyiita. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Taani Ta Aabbu Taana besseeddawaa haasayay; k'ay hinttenttukka hinttenttu aawuwaappe siseeddawaa ootsiita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Unttunttu zaariide, «Nu aabbu Abraahaama» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesuusi unttuntta, «Hinttenttu Abraahaamo naanaa gideeddentto, I ootseedda oosuwaa malaa ootsanita. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Shin S'oossaappe siseedda tumuwaa odeedda Taana hinttenttu wod'anaw koyyiita; Abraahaame hewaadan ootsibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Hinttenttu, hinttenttu aawuu ootseeddawaa ootsiita» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Unttunttu zaariide, «Nuuni woshumaan dik'aalatetsaa yelettibeykko; nuw itti Aawuu, S'oossaa s'alalay de'ee» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Hinttenttu S'oossaa naanaa tumu gideeddentto, Taana siik'ana; ayaw gooppe, Taani S'oossaa matappe yaade hawaan de'ay. Taana I kiitteeddawaappe attin, Taani Ta sheniyaan yabeykke. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Taani tamaarissiyaawaa hinttenttu akeekenawe ayaasee? Taani tamaarissiyaawaa hinttenttu akkena diraassa. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Hinttenttu, hinttenttu aawuwaa iita ayaanaa naanaa; k'ay hinttenttu, hinttenttu aawuu amottiyaawaa ootsanaw koyyiita. I kaseppe doommiide, shemppuwaa wod'eeddawaa; tumatetsay aan baynna diraw, tumatetsaakko shiik'i erenna. I wordduwaa haasayiyaa wode, bareppe haasayee; ayaw gooppe, I worddanchchaanne k'ay worddookka aawuwaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Shin Taani tumuwaa haasayiyaa diraw, hinttenttu Taana ammanikkita. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Hintteppe Taana nagaraa ootsishshin be'aaddi gaanaw danddayiyaawe oonee? Taani tumuwaa haasayiyaawaa gidoppe, Taana ayaw ammanikkitee? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>S'oossaa asaa gideedda uray S'oossay giyaawaa sisee; hinttenttu S'oossaa asaa gidenna diraw, S'oossay giyaawaa sisikkita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Abraahaamoppe Kasennakka De'ee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Ayihudatuu zaariide, «Nuuni neena, ‹Neeni Sammaariyaa asaa; neenan iita ayyaanay de'ee› giidde bayizzeeddoo?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Ta bolla iita ayyaanay baawa. Taani Ta Aabba bonchchay; shin hinttenttu Taana kawushshiita. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Taani Ta huup'iyaw bonchchuwaa koyyikke; hewaa Taw koyyiyaawenne pirddiyaawe de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; Taani tamaarissiyaawaa naagiyaa ooninne ubbakka hayk'k'enna» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Ayihudatuu zaariide, «Ne bolla iita ayyaanay de'iyaawaa nuuni ha"i ereeddo. Abraahaame hayk'k'eedda; nabatuu hayk'k'eeddino; shin neeni, ‹Ta k'aalaa naagiyaa ooninne ubbakka hayk'k'enna› yaaga. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Neeni hayk'k'eedda nu aawuwaa Abraahaamoppe daray? Nabatuu k'ay hayk'k'eeddino. Neeni neena oona gaade k'oppay?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesuusi, «Taani Taana bonchchooppe, Ta bonchchuu mela; hinttenttu nu S'oossaa giyaa Ta Aabbu Taana bonchchee. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Hinttenttu Aa erana d'ayooppekka, Taani Aa eray. Taani Aa erikke gooppe, hinttenttuwaadan worddo giday; shin Taani Aa eray; k'ay Aa k'aalaakka naagay. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Hinttenttu aawuu Abraahaame, Ta yuussaa wodiyaa be'anaw laamoteedda; be'iidekka nashetteedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Ayihudatuu zaariide Aa, «New haray atto ishatamu laytsaa kumibeennawe Abraahaama be'aaddii?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; Abraahaamo yelettanaappekka kase Taani Taana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Hewaa diraw, unttunttu Yesuusa c'addanaw shuchchaa akkeeddino; shin Yesuusi unttunttuppe geemettiide, Geeshsha Golliyaappe beedda.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi K'ook'a Gidiide Yeletteedda Bitaniyaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesuusi biidde, yelettoodeppe k'ook'a gidiide de'iyaa itti bitaniyaa be'eedda. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu Yesuusa, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, ha bitanii k'ook'a gidiide yelettanaadan, nagaraa ootseeddawe oonee? I ootseedeeyye? Woy Aa yeleeddawanttu ootseeddinoo?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesuusi, «S'oossaa kiitay Aa bollan k'onc'c'ana mala k'ook'eeddappe attin, I woy Aa daayanne Aa aabbu nagaraa ootsibeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Nuuni sa'ay k'ammennaan de'ishshin, Taana kiitteeddawaa oosuwaa ootsanaw bessee. Ooninne ootsanaw danddayenna k'ammay yee. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Taani alamiyaan de'aadde alamew poo'o» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Yesuusi hewaa giide, sa'aan c'uchcheedda; bare c'uchchaan guutsa urk'k'aa shugissiide, he urk'k'aan k'ook'a bitaniyaa ayfiyaa okkiide, <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>«Baade Salihooma giyaa dagatteedda haatsaan ne ayfiyaa meec'c'a» yaageedda. «Salihooma» giyaawe «Kiitetteeddawaa» guussaa. Hewaa diraw, bitanii biide, bare ayfiyaa meec'ettiide, s'eelliidde simmeedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Bitaniyaa shooratuunne bitanii kase woossishin be'eedda asay, «Hawe uttiide woossiyaa bitaniyaa gidenneeyee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>K'ay amareedawanttu, «Hawe aattennee» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Haranttu k'ay, «Tuytti, hawe Aa malatiyaawaappe attin, Aa gidenna» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Shin bitanii, «Taani aattee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Unttunttu bitaniyaa, «Yaatina, ne ayfii waan s'eelleeddee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>I zaariide, «Yesuusa geetettiyaa bitanii guutsa urk'k'aa shugissiide, ta ayfiyaa okkiide, ‹Salihooma geetettiyaa dagatteedda haatsaani baade ne ayfiyaa meec'etta› yaageedda. Taani baade meec'ettaade s'eellaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Unttunttu Aa, «I hak'an de'ii?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Bitanii, «Taani erikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Unttunttu kase k'ook'iide s'eelleedda bitaniyaa Parisaawatuwaakko afeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Yesuusi urk'k'aa shugissiide, bitaniyaa ayfiyaa patseedda gallassay Sambbata gallassaa. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Hewaa diraw, bitanii waan s'eelleeddenttonne Parisaawatuu Aa gujjiide oochcheeddino. Bitanii unttunttoo, «I ta ayfiyaan guutsa urk'k'aa wotseedda. Ta ayfiyaa meec'ettaade ha"i s'eellaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Parisaawatuwaappe ittuu ittuu, «Hawaa ootseedda bitanii Sambbataa higgiyaa naagenna diraw, S'oossaa mataappe yibeenna» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Shin haranttu, «Nagaranchcha Asay hawaa mala wolk'k'aama malaataa waan ootsanaw danddayii?» yaagiide unttunttu barenttu gidduwaan shaaketteeddino.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Hewaa diraw, Parisaawatuu bitaniyaa itti kaala gujjiide, «I ne ayfiyaa dooyyeedda diraw, aabaa waagay?» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Bitanii, «I nabiyaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Ayihudatuu he s'eelleedda bitaniyaa aattonne aawuwaa s'eesiide oochchana gakkanaw, bitanii k'ook'a gideeddawaanne ha"i I s'eelliyaawaa ammanibeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Ayihudatuu Aa aattonne aawuwaa, «Hinttenttu, ‹K'ook'a gidiide yeletteedda› giyaa hinttenttu na'ay hawe? Yaatina, ha"i waaniide s'eelleeddee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Bitaniyaa daayanne aawuu, «Hawe nu na'aa gideeddawaanne k'ook'a gidiide yeletteeddawaa nuuni ereetto. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Shin ha"i I waan s'eelleeddentto, nuuni erokko; woy Aa ayfiyaa ooni patseeddentto, nuuni erokko. Aa oochchite; I donzza asaa; barebaa haasayanaw danddayee!» yaageeddino. <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Bitaniyaa daayanne aawuu Ayihudatoo yayyeedda diraw, hewaa geeddino; ayaw gooppe, Ayihudatuu Yesuusi Kiristtoosa yaagiide markkattiyaa uray de'ooppe, he uraa Ayihuda woosa golliyaappe kessanaw kaseti k'ofaa k'achchi wotseeddino. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Aa daayanne aawuu, «I donzza asaa; Aa oochchite!» geeddawe hawaassa.<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Hewaa diraw, k'ook'a gidiide yeletteedda bitaniyaa unttunttu laa'entsuwaa s'eesiide, «S'oossaa galataa; ha bitanii nagaranchcha gidiyaawaa nuuni ereetto» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Bitanii, «I nagaranchcha gidiyaawaanne, gidennawaa erikke; taani k'ook'a gidiyaawaanne ha"i s'eelliyaawaa he ittibaa eray» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Unttunttu zaariide bitaniyaa, «I new ayaa ootseedee? I ne ayfiyaa wooti patseedee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>I unttuntta, «Taani hinttenttoo odaaddi; sisibeykkita. Ayaw laa'entsuwaa sisanaw koyyiitee? Hinttekka Yesuusa kaalliyaawantta gidanaw koyyiitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Unttunttu Aa boriidde, «Neeni he bitaniyaa kaalliyaawaa; nuuni Musa kaalliyaawantta. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>S'oossay Musew haasayeeddawaa nuuni ereetto; shin ha bitaniyaa gidooppe, I hak'appe yeeddenttonne nuuni erokko» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Bitanii, «I hak'appe yeeddenttonne hinttenttu erennawe maalalissiyaawaa; shin I ta ayfiyaa patseedda! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>S'oossaw yayyiyaa uraynne S'oossay koyyiyaawaa ootsiyaa uray de'ooppe, he uraabaa S'oossay sisiyaawaappe attin, nagaranchchatuwaabaa sisenna. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>K'ook'a gidiide yeletteedda asaa ayfiyaa ooninne patsina, sa'ay med'ettoodeppe doommina, sisetti erenna. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Ha bitanii S'oossaappe yibeennawaa gidintto, ittibaanne ootsanawukka danddayenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Unttunttu zaariide aw, «Neeni nagaraan yelettaade dic'c'eeddawe nuuna tamaarissanaw koyyay?» yaageeddino; Ayihuda woosa golliyaappe kare Aa kesseeddino.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wozanaa K'ook'atetsaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Unttunttu bitaniyaa kare kesseeddawaa Yesuusi siseedda; Yesuusi bitaniyaa demmiide, «Asaa Na'aa ammanay?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Bitanii Yesuusa, «Godaw, taani Aa ammananaadan I oonee? Taw odaarikkii!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesuusi bitaniyaa, «Neeni Aa be'aadda; ha neenanna haasayiyaawekka Aa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Bitanii zaariide, «Godaw, ammanay» yaagiide Yesuusaw goyinneedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yesuusi, «K'ook'atuu s'eelana malanne s'eelliyaawanttu k'ook'ana mala, taani pirddanaw ha sa'aa yaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Aanana de'iyaa amareeda Parisaawatuu hewaa sisiide, «Nuunikka k'ook'eyee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesuusi, «Hinttenttu k'ook'a gideeddentto, hinttenttoo nagaraa gidenna; shin ha"i hinttenttu, ‹Nuuni s'eelleetto› yaagiita; hinttenttu nagaraanna de'iita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Lo"o Hentsanchchaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yesuusi, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; dorssaa sikuwaa penggiyaanna gelennaan harasaanna geliyaa ooninne kaysuwaanne paannuwaa. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Shin penggiyanna geliyaawe dorssaa heemmiyaa asaa. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Penggiyaa naagiyaawe aw penggiyaa dooyyee; dorssatuukka Aa kooshshaa sisana; I bare dorssatuwaa unttunttu suntsan suntsan s'eesiide, kare kaaletsana. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>I barewantta kare kesseeddawaappe guyyiyaan, unttunttuppe sintsanna hamettee; unttunttukka Aa kooshshaa eriyaa diraw, Aa kaalliino. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Hara uraa kooshshaa unttunttu erenna diraw, aappe bak'atanaappe attin, Aa geeduwaa kaallikkino» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesuusi unttunttoo ha leemisuwaa odeedda; shin I unttunttoo ay odinttonekka unttunttu akeekibeykkino.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Yesuusi k'aykka unttunttoo, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; taani dorssatoo geliyaa penggiyaa. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Taappe kase yeedda ubbay kayisuwaanne paannuwaa; shin dorssatuu unttunttu giyaawaa sisibeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Penggii taana; taanan geliyaa ooninne attanawaa. I gelananne kesana; k'ay lo"o maatay de'iyaa saakka demmanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Kayisuu wuu"anaw, wod'anawunne d'ayissanaw yiyaawaappe attin, harabaw yeenna; taani unttunttoo de'uu de'ana malanne kumiide palahana mala yaad.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>«Taani dorssaa loytsa heemmiyaawaa; dorssaa loytsi heemmiyaawe he dorssatuwaa diraw hayk'k'ee. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Miishshaa akkiide heemmiyaa uray walliyaa yiyaa wode be'iide, dorssatuwaa yeggi bashiide bak'atee. Ayaw gooppe, dorssatuu aawantta gidikkino; k'ay ikka dorssatuwaa heemmiyaawaa gidenna. Hewaa diraw, dorssatuwaa oyk'k'eenne laalee. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Shaluwaa akkiide heemmiyaawe bare shaloo heemmiyaa dirawunne dorssaabay Aa k'ofetsenna diraw, dorssatuwaa aggiide bak'atee.<verse eid="JHN 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15"/>«Taani dorssaa loytsa heemmiyaawaa; Ta Aabbu Taana eriyaawaadan, Taanikka k'ay Ta Aabba eray. Hewaadankka, Taani Ta dorssatuwaa eray; Ta dorssatuukka Taana eriino. K'ay Taani Ta dorssatuwaa diraw, hayk'k'anaw koyaad. <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Ha sikkuwaan baynna hara dorssatuukka Taw de'iino. Taani unttunttakka ahanaw bessee. K'ay unttunttu Ta kooshshaa sisana; itti wudii de'ana; heemmiyaawekka ittuwaa gidanawaa.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>«Taani Ta shemppuwaa zaaraadde akkana mala, aatsaade immanaw koyyiyaa diraw, Ta Aabbu Taana siik'ee. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Taani dosaade Ta shemppuwaa aatsa immiyaawaappe attin, Taappe ooninne akkena. Taw Ta shemppuwaa aatsa immiyaa maatay de'ee; k'ay zaaraadde akkanawukka maatay de'ee. Taani ha azazuwaa Ta Aawuwaappe akkaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>He haasayaa diraw, Ayihudatuwaa gidduwaan k'aykka shaakuu med'etteedda. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Unttunttuppe dariyaa baggay, «Aan s'alahii de'ee! I gooyee! Aa haasayaa ayaw sisiitee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Haratuu k'ay «S'alahii oyk'k'eedda Asay hawaadan haasayenna; s'alahii k'ook'a asaa ayfiyaa s'eelissanaw danddayiiyee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Is's'etteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Yerusaalamen Geeshsha Golliyaa anjjisseedda gallassaa hassayissiyaa Baalay gakkeedda; sa'ay he wode balgguwaa. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaan Solomona baranddaan, yaanne haanne hamettee. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Ayihudatuu Yesuusa matan yuuyyi aad'd'iide, «Neeni nuuna awude gakkanaw sid'issaadde wotsanii? Neeni Kiristtoosa giddoppe, nuw geeshshaade oda» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesuusi unttunttoo zaariide, «Taani hinttenttoo odaaddi; shin Taana ammanikkita; Taani Ta Aabbu suntsan ootsiyaa kiitay Tabaa markkattee. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Shin hinttenttu Ta dorssaa gidenna diraw ammanikkita. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Ta dorssatuu Ta kooshshaa sisiino; Taani unttuntta eray; unttunttukka Taana kaalliino. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Taani unttunttoo med'inaa de'uwaa immay; k'ay unttunttu ubbakka hayk'k'ikkino. Ooninne Ta kushiyaappe unttuntta wotsi akkanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Unttuntta Taw immeedda Ta Aabbu ooppenne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ooppenne: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ubbaappe guussaa.</char></note> aad'd'ee; ooninne Ta Aabbu kushiyaappe unttuntta wotsi akkanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Tanne Ta Aabbu ittuwaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Ayihudatuu Yesuusa c'addanaw k'aykka shuchchaa dentseeddino. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taani ootsanaw Ta Aabbu Taw immeedda daro lo"o oosuwaa hinttentta bessaaddi; hewanttuppe hak'awanttu diraw, Taana shuchchaan c'addanaw koyyiitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Ayihudatuu zaariide, «Nuuni neena lo"o oosuwaa diraw, shuchchaan c'addanaw koyyokko; shin neeni S'oossaa bolla boriyaa k'aalaa haasayiyaa dirawunne k'ay asaa gidaadde ne huup'iyaa S'oossaa ootseedda diraw, c'addanaw koyyeetto!» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Wog. 24:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Hinttenttu higgiyan S'oossay, ‹Hintte s'oossatuwaa› geeddawe s'aafettibeennee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Maz. 82:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>S'oossaa Mas'aafatuwaa laammanaw danddayettenna; S'oossay bare k'aalay yeedda asatuu, ‹s'oossatuwaa› giide s'eeseeddawaa gidooppe, <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Taani, ‹Taani S'oossaa Na'aa› geedda diraw, Ta Aabbu anjjiide, sa'aa kiitteedda Taana, ‹S'oossaa bolla boriyaa k'aalaa haasayaa› yaagiitee? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Taani Ta Aabbu ootsiyaawaa ootsana d'ayooppe, Taana ammanoppite. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Shin Taani ootsiyaawaa gidooppe, haray atto hinttenttu Taana ammanana d'ayooppekka, Ta Aabbu Taanan de'iyaawaanne Taanikka Ta Aabbun de'iyaawaa eranaadaaninne akeekanaadan, Ta oosuwaa ammanite» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>K'aykka unttunttu Aa oyk'k'anaw koyyeeddino; shin I unttunttuppe kessi akkiide beedda.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Yohaannisi kase s'ammak'iyaasaa Yorddaanoosa Shaafaappe hefintsa Yesuusi pinniide, yaan de'eedda. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Daro Asay Yesuusakko yiide, «Yohaannisi wolk'k'aama malaataa ootsibeenna; shin I ha bitaniyaabaa haasayeeddabay ubbay tuma» yaageeddino. <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Yaan daro Asay Yesuusa ammaneedda.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Ali'aazara Hayk'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Biitaaniyaa giyaa k'eeri katamaan Ali'aazara giyaa itti bitanii harggeedda; he katamay Mayraamanne izi michchata Martta de'eedda katamaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Godaa gediyaa shittuwaa okkaade, bare binnanaan Aa gediyaa k'uc'c'eeddawunna he Mayraamo; harggeeddawe k'ay izi ishaa Ali'aazara. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Hewaa diraw, michchatuu, «Godaw, neeni siik'iyaawe harggeedda» giide Yesuusaw kiitteeddino.<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Yesuusi hewaa siseedda wode, «Taani S'oossaa Na'ay harggiyaa gaasuwaan bonchchettana mala, S'oossaa bonchchoo ha harggii Ali'aazara oyk'k'eeddappe attin, wod'iyaa harggiyaa gidenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Yesuusi Martto, izi michchatonne Ali'aazara siik'ee; <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Ali'aazar harggeeddawaa Yesuusi siseedda wode, bare de'iyaa sa'aan laa"u gallassaa peesheedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta «Laa'entsuwaa Yihudaa gadiyaa boytte» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu zaariide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, guutsa wodiyaappe kase Ayihudatuu neena shuchchaan c'addanaw koyyeeddino; k'aykka yaa baanii?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesuusi, «Itti gallassan tammanne laa"u saatii de'enneeyye? Gallassi hamettiyaa Asay d'ubettenna; ayaw gooppe, I ha sa'aa poo'uwaa be'ee. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Shin k'amma hamettiyaa uray de'ooppe, poo'uu aan baynna diraw, d'ubettee» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Yesuusi hewaa geeddawaappe guyyiyaan, k'aykka unttunttoo, «Nu dabbuu Ali'aazar gem"isheedda; shin gem"ishuwaappe Aa dentsanaw Taani bay» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu zaariide, «Godaw, I gem"isheeddawaa gidooppe, aw lo"anawaa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Ali'aazar hayk'k'eeddawaa Yesuusi odeedda; shin Ali'aazar gem"ishiide giseeddawaa odeedda giide, unttunttu k'oppeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Hewaa diraw, Yesuusi geeshshiide unttuntta, «Ali'aazar hayk'k'eedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Hinttenttu ammanana mala, taani he sa'aan de'ennawoo, hinttenttu diraw nashettay. Shin denddite; aakko boytte» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, manttiyaa geetettiyaa Toomaasi bare laggetsatuwaa Yesuusa kaalliyaawantta, «Yesuusanna hayk'k'anaw nuunikka k'ay boytte!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi, Dendduwaanne De'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Yesuusi gakkiyaa wode, Ali'aazaraw moogettoodeppe oyddu gallassaa gideeddawaa demmeedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Biitaaniyaa katamay Yerusaalameppe heezzu kiilo miitiriyaa keenaa haakkee. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Daro Ayihudatuu Marttonne Mayraamo unttunttu ishay hayk'k'eeddawoo mentsetsanaw yeeddino.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Martta Yesuusi yeeddawaa sisaadde, Aa mokkanaw kessaaddu; shin Mayraama gollen ataadu. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Martta Yesuusa, «Godaw, neeni hawaan de'eeddawaa gidintto, ta ishay hayk'k'enna. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Shin neeni woossiyaawaa ay gidooppenne, S'oossay new haray atto ha"ikka immanawaa taani eray» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesuusi, «Ne ishay hayk'uwaappe denddana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Martta, «Wodiyaa wurssetsaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Wodiyaa wurssetsaan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'oossay asaa zeretsaa ubbaa pirddaw shiishshiyaa wode guussaa.</char></note> dendduwaa gallassi, I hayk'uwaappe denddanawaa taani eray» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesuusi iziw, «Taani dendduwaanne de'uwaa; Taana ammaniyaa uray haray atto, hayk'k'ooppekka de'uwaan de'anawaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>K'ay de'uwaan de'iyaa uraynne Taana ammaniyaa uray ubbay ubbaakka hayk'k'enna; hewaa neeni ammanay?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Martta zaaraadde, «Godaw, Ee taani ammanay; neeni S'oossaa Na'aa, sa'aa yaanaw de'iyaa Kiristtoosa gidiyaawaa taani ammanay» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Martta hewaa geeddawaappe guyyiyaan, baade bare michchatiw geeman s'eesaade, «Tamaarissiyaawe yiide, neena koyyee» yaagaaddu. <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Mayraama hewaa siseedda wode, elleella dendda ek'k'aade Yesuusakko baaddu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Yesuusi Martta Aa mokkeedda sa'aan de'eeppe attin, biro k'eeri katamaa gakkibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Mayraamo mentsetsiidde, gollen izinna de'iyaa Ayihudatuu, iza ellekka dendda ek'k'aade kare kesiyaawaa be'iide, Ali'aazar moogetteedda duufuwaa baade yaan yeekkanaw hanaw yaagiide, izo kaalliide keseeddino.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Mayraama Yesuusi de'iyaasaa baade Yesuusa be'eedda wode, Aa gediyaa bollan kunddaaddu; «Godaw, neeni hawaan de'eeddawaa gidintto, ta ishay hayk'k'enna shin!» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesuusi iza yeekkiyaawaanne k'ay izinna yeedda Ayihudatuukka yeekkiyaawaa be'iide, bare wozanaan daro seeletteedda; k'ay tookki shemppeedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Unttuntta, «Hak'an moogeedditee?» yaagiide oochchina, «Godaw, yaade be'a» yaagiide zaareeddino.<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesuusi afos's'eedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Hewaa diraw, Ayihudatuu, «Ali'aazara I ay keenaa siik'intto be'ite!» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Shin unttunttuppe ittuu ittuu, «Hawe k'ook'a bitaniyaa s'eelisseeddawe ha bitanii hayk'k'ennaadan udanaw danddayennee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Ali'aazara Hayk'uwaappe Dentseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Yesuusi k'aykka wozanaappe k'arettiide, Ali'aazar moogetteedda duufuwaakko beedda; he duufuu gonggoluwaa gidiide shuchchaan k'um"etti utteedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesuusi, «Shuchchaa diggite!» yaagiide azazeedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Hayk'k'eedda bitaniyaa michchata Martta, «Godaw, I hayk'k'oodeppe oyddu gallassaa gideedda diraw, ha"i s'ink'k'anawaa!» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesuusi Martto, «Ammaniyaawaa gidooppe, neeni S'oossaa bonchchuwaa be'anawaa Taani new odabeykkitaa?» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Unttunttu shuchchaa dentseeddino; Yesuusi saluwaa pude s'eelliide, «Aawoo, Taani giyaawaa neeni siseedda diraw, neena galatay. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Neeni ubbaa wode sisiyaawaa Taani eray; shin hawaan yuuyyi aad'd'iide ek'k'eedda Asay neeni Taana kiitteeddawaa ammanana mala, hawaa Taani unttunttu diraw gay» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Yesuusi hewaa geeddawaappe guyyiyaan, bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Ali'aazaraa, haa kessa!» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Hayk'k'eedda Ali'aazara kushiinne gedii shaluwaan k'ashetti uttiide Aa deemuukka afilaan kametti utteeddawe kesina Yesuusi unttuntta, «Billi aggite! Bo!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa Bolla Mak'k'eteeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk'. 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Hewaa diraw, Mayraamikko yeedda Ayihudatuwaappe c'oratuu Yesuusi ootseeddawaa be'iide, Aa ammaneeddino. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Shin unttunttuppe ittuu ittuu Parisaawatuwaakko biide, Yesuusi ootseeddawaa unttunttoo odeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne Parisaawatuu shiik'uwaa shiishshiide, «Ha bitanii daro wolk'k'aama malaataa ootsiyaa diraw, ayaa ootsanee? <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Nuuni Aa c'o"u giide, aggooppe, Asay ubbay Aa ammananawaa; k'ay Roome gadiyaa asatuu yiide, nu Geeshsha Golliyaanne nu asaa d'ayissana» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Unttunttuppe ittuu K'ayaafaa giyaa, he laytsi k'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappo gideeddawe, «Hinttenttu ayinne erikkita! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Asay ubbay d'ayiyaawaappe asaa ubbaa diraw, itti Asay hayk'k'iyaawe lo"a gidiyaawaa hinttenttu akeekite?» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>I hewaa bareppe gibeenna; shin he laytsi k'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappo gidiyaa diraw, Yesuusi Ayihuda asaa diraw hayk'k'anaw bessiyaawaa Nabii odeedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>K'ay Yesuusi Ayihuda asaa s'alalaw hayk'k'enna; shin laaletti de'iyaa S'oossaa naanaa ittuwaa ootsi shiishshanaw hayk'k'anawaa.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>He gallassaappe doommiide, unttunttu Aa wod'anaw mak'k'eteeddino. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Hewaa diraw, Yesuusi Ayihudatuu gidduwaan k'onc'c'iyaan yaa haa hamettibeenna; shin mela biittaa gas'aan de'iyaa gadiyaa, Efireema geetettiyaa katamaa beedda. Barena kaalliyaawanttunna hewaan takkeedda.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Ayihudatuu Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassay mateedda; k'ay daro Asay barena geeshshanaw, Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassay gakkanaappe kase dumma dumma saappe Yerusaalame beedda. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Unttunttu Yesuusa koyyiino; Geeshsha Golliyaan ek'k'iide, «Ayaa k'oppiitee? Paasigaa bonchchiyaasaa Yesuusi yeennee?» yaagiide ittuu ittuwaa oochcheeddino. <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>K'ay k'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne Parisaawatuu Yesuusa k'achchanaw, I de'iyaasaa eriyaawe ooninne barenttoo odana mala azazeeddino.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Shittuwaa Okkeedda Mishiratto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar. 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassaappe usuppun gallassaa kasetiide, Yesuusi I hayk'uwaappe dentseedda Ali'aazar de'iyaa Biitaaniyaa giyaa katamaa beedda. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>He sa'aan unttunttu aw kawuwaa katseeddino; Ali'aazar aanana uttiide ittippe miyaawanttu giddon utti de'ishshin, Martta kawuwaa gisha mizaaddu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Mayraama daro shaluwaan zal"ettiyaa itti s'aaramusiyaa gidiyaa narddoosa geetettiyaa geeshsha shittuwaa ahaade, Yesuusa gediyaa okkaade bare binnanaan Aa gediyaa k'uc'c'aaddu; golliyaa ubbay shittuwaa sawuwaan toshikku gee.<verse eid="JHN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Shin Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu, Yesuusa aatsi immanawe, Yihudaa Ask'k'orootu, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>«Ha shittuu heezzu s'eetu diinaariyaani zal"ettina, ayaw hewe hiyyeesaw imettennee?» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>I kayisuwaa gideedda diraw, hewaa geeddappe attin, hiyyeesaw k'arettiide gibeenna; I miishshaa k'arc'c'iitiyaa oyk'k'iyaawaa gidiyaa diraw, ubbaa wode aappe barew akkeedda.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Yesuusi, «Ha shittuwaa Taani moogettiyaa gallassay gakkanaw iza ayaw minjjanee? Izo aggite. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Hiyyeesatuu ubbaa wode hinttenanna de'ana; shin Taani ubbaa wode hinttenana de'ikke» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Zar. 15:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Ayihudatuwaappe daro Asay Yesuusi Biitaaniyaan de'iyaawaa sisiide, yaa beedda; unttunttu Yesuusa be'ana gishsha s'alalaw gidennaan, I hayk'uwaappe dentseedda Ali'aazarakka be'anaw beeddino. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Hewaa diraw, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu Ali'aazarakka k'ay wod'anaw mak'k'eteeddino. <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Ayaw gooppe, Ali'aazara gaasuwaan daro Ayihudatuu barena kaaletsiyaawantta aggiide, Yesuusa ammaniino.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bonchchuwaan Yerusaalame Geleedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk'. 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Wonttetsa gallassi Paasigaa bonchchiyaasaa yeedda daro Asay Yesuusi Yerusaalame biyaawaa siseedda. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Yaatiide zambbaa haytsaa oyk'k'iide,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zambbaa haytsaa oyk'k'iide: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawe Ayihuda Asay eretteedda asaa mokkiyaa wogaa.</char></note> Aa mokkanaw keseeddino. Barenttu kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«S'oossay galatetto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:13">S'oossaa suntsan yiyaa Israa'eeliyaa kaatii anjjetteeddawaa!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:13">yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Maz. 118:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14-15"/>S'oossaa Mas'aafay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:14-15">«S'iyoone katamaw, yayyoppa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:14-15">Be'a, ne kaatii hare maraa bolla uttiide yee»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:14-15">giyaawaadan, Yesuusi hare maraa demmiide, Aa toggeedda.<verse eid="JHN 12:14-15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu hewaa kase akeekibeykkino; shin Yesuusi bonchchetteeddawaappe guyyiyaan, S'oossaa Mas'aafay hewaa ubbaa geeddawaanne k'ay unttunttukka hewaa ubbaa Yesuusaw ootseeddawaa hassayeeddino.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Ali'aazar moogetteedda gonggoluwaappe Yesuusi Aa s'eesiide, hayk'uwaappe dentseedda wode, Yesuusanna de'iyaa daro Asay Yesuusaw markkatteedda. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Daro Asay Aa mokkanaw kesseeddawe, I he wolk'k'aama maalaliyaawaa ootseedda diraassa. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Hewaa diraw, Parisaawatuu ittuu ittuwaa, «Hinttenttu ayinne ootsanaw danddayennawaa be'iitee! Be'ite, gade ubbay Aa geeduwaa kaalleedda» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassi goyinnanaw Yerusaalame beeddawanttu giddon itti itti Giriike asatuu de'iino. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Unttunttu Galiilaa gadiyaan Beetesayda geetettiyaa katamaappe yeedda Pilip'p'oosakko biide, «Godaw, nuuni Yesuusa be'anaw koyeetto» yaagiide woosseeddino. <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Pilip'p'oosi biide, Inddiraasaw odina laa"atuukka biide, Yesuusaw odeeddino.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesuusi unttunttoo hawaadan yaageedda; «Taani, Asaa Na'ay, bonchchettiyaa saatii gakkeedda. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; itti zarggaa ayfatta biittaan wod'd'aade wook'k'ana d'ayooppe, barekka attaw. Shin he zarggaa ayfatta wook'k'ooppe, daro ayfiyaa ayfaw. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Bare shemppuwaa siik'iyaa ooninne bayizzee; k'ay bare shemppuwaa ha sa'aan is's'iyaa ooninne med'inaa de'oo ashshee. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Ooninne Taw ootsooppe, Taana kaallanaw bessee; k'ay Taani de'iyaa sa'aan Taw ootsiyaawekka de'anawaa. Taw ootsiyaa oonanne, Ta Aabbukka Aa bonchchanawaa.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>«Ha"i Ta shemppuu daro un"etteedda; yaatina waagoo? Taani, ‹Ta Aabboo, Taana ha saatattippe ashsharikki› yaagoo? Tuytti, Taani ha saatiyaan yeeddawe hawaa diraassa. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Ta Aabboo, ne suntsaa bonchcha» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">He wode saluwaappe, «Taani Ta suntsaa bonchchaad; k'aykka gujjaade bonchchana» yaagiyaa k'aalay yeedda.<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>He sa'aan ek'k'eedda c'ora Asay he k'aalaa sisiide, «Hewe guuguntsaa» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:29">Haranttu k'ay, «Kiitanchchay aw haasayeedda» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Yesuusi zaariide unttuntta, «Ha k'aalay hinttenttu diraw yeeddawaappe attin, Ta diraassa gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Ha sa'ay pirddettiyaa wodii ha"a; ha sa'aa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ha sa'aa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay ha alamiyaa gidiide ha Yohaannisa mishiraachchuwaan de'iyaa ha sa'aa giyaawe ha sa'aa bolla de'iyaa asaanne unttunttu kahaa baressa ootsiide mooddiyaa iitaa ayaanaa wolk'k'aa bessee.</char></note> mooddiyaawe ha"i kare olettanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>K'ay Taani mask'k'aliyaa bolla kak'ettiyaa wode, asaa ubbaa Taakko goochchana» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>I hewaa geeddawe ay mala hayk'uwaa I hayk'k'anenttonne unttuntta erissanaassa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Daro Asay zaariide Yesuusa, «Nu higgii Kiristtoosi med'inaw de'iyaawaa odee. Yaatina, neeni waagaade, ‹Asaa Na'ay mask'k'aliyaa bolla kak'k'etana› gay? He Asaa Na'ay oonee?» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz. 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Hiz. 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan. 7:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesuusi, «Poo'uu hinttenanna guutsa wodiyaa gam"anawaa. Hinttenttoo d'umenna mala, poo'uu de'ishshin, poo'uwaan hamettite. D'umaan hamettiyaa uray hak'a binttonne erenna. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Poo'uwaa asaa gidana mala, hinttenttoo poo'uu de'ishshin, poo'uwaa ammanite» yaageedda. Yesuusi hewaa haasayeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, biide unttunttuppe geemetteedda.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayihudatuu Ammanennaan Is's'eedda Hanotaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37-38"/>I hewaa keena wolk'k'aama malaataa unttunttu sintsan ootsooppekka, nabiyaa Isiyaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:37-38">«Godaw, nu markkatetsaa ooni ammaneeddee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:37-38">Goday bare wolk'k'aa oona besseedee?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:37-38">geeddawe tuma gidana mala, unttunttu Aa ammanibeykkino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:37-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa. 53:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:37-38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39-40"/>Isiyaasi k'aykka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">«Unttunttu ayfii s'eellenna mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">unttunttu wozanaykka akeekena mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">unttunttu S'oossaakko simmina, I unttuntta patsenna mala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:39-40">S'oossay unttunttu ayfiyaa k'ook'isseedda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">Unttunttu wozanaa dammisseedda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:39-40">geedda diraw, unttunttu ammananaw danddayibeykkino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa. 6:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:39-40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isiyaasi Yesuusa bonchchuwaa be'eedda dirawunne k'ay aabaa haasayeedda diraw,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isiyaasi Yesuusa bonchchuwaa be'eedda dirawunne k'ay aabaa haasayeedda diraw, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Woy Isiyaasi S'oossaa bonchchuwaa be'eedda dirawunne k'ay Yesuusabaa haasayeedda diraw,</char></note> hewaa geedda.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Hewaa gidinakka, haray atto Ayihudatuu kaappatuwaappekka c'oratuu Yesuusa ammaneeddino. Shin Parisaawatuu barena Ayihudatuu woosa golliyaappe kessiino giide yayyeedda diraw, ammaneedda giide markkattibeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Ayaw gooppe, unttunttu S'oossaa sabaappe aatsiide, asaa sabaa siik'eeddino.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yesuusi bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide yaageedda; «Taana ammaniyaa ooninne Taana kiitteeddawaakka ammaniyaawaappe attin, Ta s'alalaa ammanenna. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Taana be'iyaa ooninne Taana kiitteeddawaakka be'ee. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Taana ammaniyaa ubbay d'umaan de'enna mala, Taani poo'uwaa gidaade sa'aa yaad. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Ta k'aalaa sisiide azazettena uraa oonanne Taani pirddikke; ayaw gooppe, Taani alamiyaa ashshanaw yeeddawaappe attin, pirddanaw yabeykke. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Taana is's'iyaa oonanne k'ay Ta k'aalaa akkena oonanne pirddiyaawe de'ee. Taani odeedda k'aalay wurssetsaa gallassi he uraa pirddana. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Ayaw gooppe, Taani hawaa Taappe haasayabeykke; shin Taana kiitteedda Ta Aabbu Taani gaanawaanne haasayanawaa Taana azazeedda. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>K'ay Aa azazuu med'inaa de'uwaa ahiyaawaa Taani eray; hewaa diraw, Taani odiyaawe Ta Aabbu Taana oda giide odeeddawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bare Kaalliyaawanttu Gediyaa Meec'c'eedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassay gakkanaappe kasetiide, ha sa'aappe shaakettiide, Aawuwaakko biyaa wodii gakkeeddawaa Yesuusi ereedda; ha sa'aan de'iyaa barewantta ubbaa wode siik'eedda; wurssetsay gakkanaw unttuntta siik'eedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Yesuusinne kaalliyaawanttu kawuwaa miishshin, Simoona na'aa Yihudaa Ask'k'orootu Yesuusa aatsi immanaadan, s'alahii Aa k'ofissi wotseedda. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yesuusi bare Aawuu ubbabaa Aa kushiyan wotseeddawaa, k'ay S'oossaa matappe I yeeddawaanne, simmiide aakko baanawaa ereedda. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Yesuusi miyasaappe denddi ek'k'iide, bolla bagga mayuwaa k'aari wotsiide, poos'aa bare s'eessan danc'c'eedda. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, haatsaa meechchaa miishshaan tigiide, barena kaalliyaawanttu gediyaa meechchaanne bare s'eessan danc'c'eedda poos'an k'uc'ussaa doommeedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Yesuusi Simooni P'es'iroosakko yiina P'es'iroose, «Godaw, neeni ta gediyaa meec'c'anaw hanayiyee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesuusi zaariide Aa, «Taani ootsiyaawaa neeni ha"i erakka; shin guyyeppe eranaassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>P'es'iroose, «Neeni ta gediyaa ubbakka meec'c'akka!» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesuusi Aa, «Taani ne gediyaa meec'c'ana d'ayooppe, newunne Tawunne ittipetetsay baawa» yaagiide zaareedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simoona P'es'iroose Yesuusa, «Godaw, yaatooppe, ta gediyaa s'alalaa meec'c'oppa; ta kushiyaakka ta huup'iyaakka meec'c'a!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Bollaa meec'etti diggeedda uray ooninne gediyaappe harabaa meec'ettanaw koshshenna; aw ubbasaykka geeshsha. K'ay hinttenttukka geeshsha; shin ubbay geeshsha gidikkita» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Ayaw gooppe, Yesuusi barena aatsi immana uray oonenttonne ereedda; I, «Hinttenttu ubbay geeshsha gidikkita» geeddawe hawaassa.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Unttunttu gediyaa meec'c'eeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi bare mayuwaa mayyiide, baresaa guyye simmi bi uttiide unttuntta yaageedda; «Taani hinttenttoo ootseeddawaa akeekiitee? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Hinttenttu Taana, tamaarissiyaawoonne Godaw giita; Taani he hinttenttu giyaawaa gidiyaa diraw, loytseeddita. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Taani hinttenttoo Godaanne hinttentta tamaarissiyaawaa gidaadde, hinttenttu gediyaa meec'c'iyaawaa gidooppe, hinttenttukka ittuu ittuwaa gediyaa meec'c'anaw bessee. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Ayaw gooppe, Taani hinttenttoo ootseeddawaadan, hinttenttukka ootsana mala, hinttenttoo leemisuwaa gidaaddi. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; k'oomay bare godaappe aad'd'enna. K'ay kiitetteedda uraykka barena kiitteeddawaappe aad'd'enna. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Hinttenttu hewaa eriide ootsiyaawaa gidooppe anjjetteeddawantta.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>«Taani hinttenttoo ubbabaa haasayikke. Taani dooreeddawantta eray; shin S'oossaa Mas'aafay, ‹Taani barsseeddawe Ta kushiyaa sa"eedda› geeddawe tuma gidanaw bessee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz. 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Hewe haniyaa wode Taani Taana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Taani Taana: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:24">Yoh. 8:24</ref> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'eellite.</char></note> gidiyaawaa hinttenttu ammanana mala, hewe hananaappe kasetaade hinttenttoo hananawaa oday. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; Taani kiittiyaa oonanne mokkiyaa uray taanakka mokkee; k'ay Taana mokkiyaa ooninne Taana kiitteeddawaa mokkee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Barena Aatsi Immanawe Oonentto Kasetiide Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat. 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mar. 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk'. 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Yesuusi hewaa haasayeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, bare wozanaan daro metootiide, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; Taana hintteppe ittuu aatsi immanawaa» giide k'onc'c'iyaan odeedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>I oona haasayinttonne, kaalliyaawanttoo ubbaakka erettennaan is's'ina, ittuu ittuwaa s'eelleeddino. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu, Yesuusi siik'iyaawe, Yesuusa matan utteedda. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Hewaa diraw, Simoona P'es'iroose he kaalliyaawaa simi"iide, «I oona gintto, ane Aa oochcha» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Hewaa diraw, he kaalliyaawe Yesuusa haytsaakko shiik'iide, «Godaw, I oonee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Taani ukitsaan c'abbaa tushaade immiyaawe Aa» yaageedda. K'ay ukitsaa mentsi akkiide, c'abbaa tushiide, Simoona na'aa, Yihudaa Ask'k'orootaw immeedda. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yihuday ukitsaa mentsowaa akkowaappe guyyiyaan, Sees'aanay ellekka Yihudaan geleedda. Yesuusi Aa, «Neeni ootsanawaa elleella ootsa!» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Shin he sa'aan utteeddawanttuppe ooninne Yesuusi hewaa Aa ayaw geeddenttonne eribeenna. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Yihuday miishshaa k'arc'c'iitiyaa oyk'k'iyaa diraw, kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu ittuu Yesuusi Yihudaa, «Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassaw barena koshshiyaawaa baade shamma woy hiyyeesaw mis'uwaataa imma geedda» yaagiide k'oppeeddino.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yihuday ukitsaa mentsowaa akkiide, ellekka kare kesseedda; he wode sa'ay k'amma.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ooratsa Azazuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yihuday kare keseeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi yaageedda; «Ha"i Taani Asaa Na'ay bonchchettaaddi: S'oossaykka Ta baggana bonchchetteedda. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>S'oossay Ta baggana, Asaa Na'aa baggana bonchchettooppe, I bare huup'ew Taana Asaa Na'aa bonchchanawaa; k'ay I Taana ellekka bonchchanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Ta naatoo, Taani hinttenanna daro wodiyaa gam"ikke. Hinttenttu Taana koyyana; shin Taani Ayihudatuwaa, ‹Taani biyaasaa hinttenttu baanaw danddaykkita› geeddawaadan, hinttewukka ha"i oday. <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Taani hinttentta ooratsa azazuwaa azazay; ittuu ittuwaa siik'ite. Taani hinttentta siik'eeddawaadankka, hinttenttu ittuu ittuwaa siik'ana bessee. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Hinttenttu ittuu ittuwaanna siik'ettooppe, Taana kaalliyaawantta gidiyaawaa Asay ubbay erana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'es'iroose Kaddanawaa Yesuusi Kasetiide Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk'. 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simooni P'es'iroose Yesuusa, «Godaw, neeni hak'a bay?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesuusi zaariide, «Taani biyaasaa neeni ha"i Taana kaallanaw danddayakka; shin guyyeppe kaallana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>P'es'iroose, «Godaw, taani neena ha"i kaallanaw ayaw danddaykkitaa? Taani ne diraw, hayk'k'anawukka giiga uttaad!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Ta diraw hayk'k'anaw ha"i tumu giiga uttaaddii? Taani new tumuwaa oday; kuttuu waassanaappe kase, neeni Taana heezzu gede kaddanaassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Aawuwaakko Afiyaa Ogiyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yesuusi kaalliyaawantta «Hinttenttu wozanay hirggoppo; S'oossaan ammanite; Taanankka ammanite.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">S'oossaan ammanite; Taanankka ammanite: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'oossaan ammanuu hinttew de'ee guussay, Taanankka ammanuu de'ee guussaa.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Ta Aabbu gollen daro sa'ay de'ee. Hewaa gidennentto, Taani hinttenttoo hewaa odikke; Taani hinttenttoo sa'aa giigissanaw bay. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Taani baade sa'aa giigisseeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Taani de'iyaa sa'aan hinttenttukka de'ana mala, simma yaade hinttentta Taakko afana. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>K'ay hinttenttu Taani biyaa ogiyaa eriita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Toomaasi, «Godaw, neeni biyaasaa nuuni erokko; ogiyaa waaniide eranaw danddayeetto?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Ogii, tumuunne de'uu Taana; Ta baggannappe attin, ooninne Ta Aabbukko baanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Hinttenttu Taana eriyaawaa gidintto, Ta Aabbakka erana; ha"ippe doommiide, hinttenttu Aa eriitanne k'ay Aa be'eeddita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Pilip'p'oosi Yesuusa, «Godaw, Aawuwaa nuuna bessa; hewe nuw gidanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesuusi zaariide yaageedda; «Pilip'p'oosaa, Taani hawaa keena wodiyaa hinttenanna de'inakka Taana erikkii? Taana be'eedda uray Aawuwaakka be'eedda; yaatina, neeni waagaade, ‹Aawuwaa nuuna bessa› gay?» <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Taani Aawuwaa giddon de'iyaawaa k'ay Aawukka Ta giddon de'iyaawaa neeni ammanikkii? Taani hinttenttoo odiyaa k'aalaa Taani Taappe odikke; shin Ta giddon de'iyaa Aawuu bare oosuwaa ootsee. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Taani Aawuwaa giddon de'iyaawaanne k'ay Aawukka Ta giddon de'iyaawaa Taana ammanite; hewe d'ayooppe, Ta oosuwaabaw Taana ammanite.<verse eid="JHN 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>«Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; Taana ammaniyaa uray Taani ootsiyaa oosuwaa ootsana. Taani Aawuwaakko biyaa diraw, he uray hawaappe aad'd'iyaa oosuwaa ootsana. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Aawuu Na'aa gaasuwaan, Ta baggana bonchchettana mala, Ta suntsan hinttenttu woossiyaa ubbabaa Taani hinttenttoo polana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Hinttenttu Ta suntsan Taana ayaanne oochchooppekka, Taani polana.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Ayaana Geeshsha Kiittanaw Immeedda Hidootaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>«Hinttenttu Taana siik'iyaawaa gidooppe, Ta azazuwaa naagana. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16-17"/>Taani Aawuwaa woosana; hinttenanna med'inaw de'ana mala, tumatetsaa Ayaanaa, hara mentsetsiyaawaa hinttenttoo I immana. Ha sa'ay he tumatetsaa Ayaana be'ennawaanne erennawaa gidiyaa diraw, Aa akkanaw danddayenna; shin I hinttenanna de'iyaa dirawunne hinttenttu giddon de'ana diraw, hinttenttu Aa eriita.<verse eid="JHN 14:16-17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>«Taani hinttentta aawuunne aata baynna yii'o naanaadan hintterekka aggabashikke; Taani simmaade hinttenttukko yaana. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan, alamii Taana laa'entsuwaa be'enna; shin hinttenttu Taana be'ana; Taani de'uwaan de'iyaa diraw, hinttenttukka k'ay de'uwaan de'ana. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Taani Ta Aawuwaa giddon de'iyaawaanne hinttenttu Ta giddon de'iyaawaa, k'ay Taani hinttenttu giddon de'iyaawaanne hinttenttu he gallassi erana.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>«Ta azazuu Aa matan de'iyaa asay, k'ay he azazuwaakka naagiyawe, I Taana siik'iyaa asaa. Taana siik'iyaa asaa Ta Aabbukka siik'ee; Taanikka Aa siik'ay. Taani aw k'onc'c'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Yihudaa Ask'k'oroota gidenna Yihuday Yesuusa, «Godaw, neeni ne huup'iyaa alamiyaa bessenaan, nuuna bessana giyaawaa waagaade gay?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesuusi, «Taana siik'iyaa ooninne Ta k'aalaa naagee; Ta Aabbu Aa siik'anawaa; k'ay Ta Aabbunne Taaninne aakko yiide, aanana de'ana. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Taana siik'enna uray ooninne Ta k'aalaw azazettena; hinttenttu sisiyaa k'aalay Taana kiitteedda Aawuwaappe attin, Tawaa gidenna.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>«Taani hinttenanna ittippe de'aadde hawaa hinttenttoo odaaddi; <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>shin Geeshsha Ayyaanay, mentsetsiyaawe, Aawuu Ta suntsan kiittanawe, hinttentta ubbabaa tamaarissanawaa. Taani hinttenttoo odeedda ubbabaakka hinttentta hassayissanawaa.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>«Taani sarotetsaa hinttenanna wotsay; Ta sarotetsaa hinttenttoo immay. Taani alamii immiyaa sarotetsaa malaa immikke. Hinttenttu hirggoppitenne yayyoppite. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Taani hinttenttoo, ‹Taani bay; shin simmaade hinttenttukko yaana› geeddawaa siseeddita; hinttenttu Taana siik'eeddawaa gidintto, Taappe Aawuu dariyaa diraw, Taani Aawuwaakko biyaawan hinttenttu nashettanita. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Hewe haniyaa wode hinttenttu ammanana mala, hewe hanennaan de'ishshin, haananna kasetaade Taani hinttenttoo odaaddi.<verse eid="JHN 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>«Ha alamiyaa mooddiyaawe yiyaa diraw, Taani hawaappe sintsan hinttenanna loytsa haasayikke. Taana I ayinne ootsanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>Shin Taani Aawuwaa siik'iyaawaa alamii eranaw bessee; k'ay Taanikka Aawuu Taana azazeeddawaadan ootsay. Denddi ek'k'ite; hawaappe boytte.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Woynniyaa Giyaa Turaw Tumu Anuu Yesuusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>«Taani woyniyaa geetettiyaa turaw tumu ano; goshshanchchay Ta Aabba. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Ta giddon de'iyaa ayfiyaa ayfena turaa maraa ubbaa I karee; ayfiyaa turaa maraa ubbay kasewaappe loytsi ayfanaadan, he maraa s'eeraa I c'iggiide geeshshana. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Taani hinttenttoo ha"i odeedda k'aalaa gaasuwaan, hinttenttu geeshsha. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Ta giddon de'ite; Taanikka hinttenttu giddon de'ana. Woynniyaa turaa maray anuwaanna ittippe de'ennaan d'ayooppe, he maray barekka ayfiyaa ayfanaw danddayennawaadan, hinttenttukka Ta giddon de'ennaan d'ayooppe, ayfiyaa ayfanaw danddaykkita.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>«Taani woyniyaa turaw ano; hinttenttu he turaa maratuwaa. Ta giddon de'iyaa uray, Taanikka Aa giddon de'iyaa uray, daro ayfiyaa ayfana; ayaw gooppe, Taani baynnaan hintterekka ayinne ootsanaw danddaykkita. <figure style="fig" alt="Grape vine on trellis" file="hk00112b.tif" size="span" ref="15:5">Woyniyaa turay bare Ayfiyaana</figure> <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Ta giddon de'enna uray turaa maraadan, karen yeggina meleeddawaa shiishshiide tamaan wotsina, I ees's'anawaa. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Hinttenttu Ta giddon de'ooppe, k'ay Ta k'aalaykka hinttenttu giddon de'ooppe, hinttenttu koyyeeddawaa ayaa gidinakka woossite; hinttenttu akkanita. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Hinttenttu daro ayfiyaa ayfooppenne k'ay Taana kaalliyaawantta gidooppe, hewan Ta Aabbu bonchchettanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Aawuu Taana siik'eeddawaadan, Taanikka hinttentta siik'aaddi; Ta siik'uwaan de'ite. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Taani Ta Aabbu azazuwaa naagaade Aa siik'uwaan de'eeddawaadan, hinttenttukka Ta azazuwaa naagooppe, Ta siik'uwaan de'anita.<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>«Ta nashechchay hinttenanna de'ana malanne, hinttenttu nashechchay kumentsaa gidana mala, Taani hawaa hinttenttoo odaaddi. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Ta azazuu hawaa; Taani hinttentta siik'iyaawaadan, hinttenttukka ittuu ittuwaanna siik'ettite. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Bare shemppuwaa bare laggew aatsiide immiyaawaappe aad'd'iyaa siik'uu oossinnekka baawa. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Taani hinttentta azazeeddawaa ubbaa ootsooppe, hinttenttu Ta laggetuwaa.<verse eid="JHN 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>«Ayilii bare goday ootsiyaawaa erenna diraw, Taani hinttentta hawaappe sintsaw ayilatuwaa giikke; shin Taani hinttentta Ta laggetuwaa gaad. Ayaw gooppe, Ta Aawuwaappe siseedda ubbabaa Taani hinttenttoo odaaddi. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Taani hinttentta dooreeddawaappe attin, hinttenttu Taana dooribeykkita. Hinttenttu biide ayfiyaa ayfana malanne de'ana mala, Taani hinttentta suntsaad. K'ay Aawuukka hinttenttu Ta suntsan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ta suntsan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Woy «Taana kaalliyaawantta gidiyaa diraw»</char></note> woosseeddawaa ubbaa immana. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Taani hinttentta azaziyaawe hawaa; ittuu ittuwaanna siik'ettite.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Ha Alamii Is's'iyaawaa Odeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>«Alamii hinttentta is's'ooppe, kasetiide Taana is's'eeddawaa akeekite. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Hinttenttu alamiyaassa gideeddentto, alamii barewaadan hinttentta siik'ana; shin Taani hinttentta alamiyaappe dooreeddawaappe attin, hinttenttu alamiyaassa gidikkita; alamii hinttentta is's'iyaawe hawaassa. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>‹Ayilii bare godaappe darenna› gaade Taani hinttenttoo odeeddawaa hassayite. Unttunttu Taana yedersseeddawaa gidooppe, hinttenakka yederssana. Unttunttu Ta k'aalaa naageeddawaa gidooppe, hinttenttu k'aalaakka naaganawantta. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Shin unttunttu Taana kiitteeddawaa erenna diraw, ha ubbaa Ta gaasuwaan unttunttu hinttenttu bolla ootsanawantta. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Taani yaade unttunttoo odennawaa gidintto, unttunttoo nagaraa gidenna; shin ha"i unttunttu ootsiyaa nagaraa gaasoyiyaawe baawa. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23-24"/>Taana is's'iyaawe Ta Aawuwaakka is's'eedda. Ooninne ootsibeenna oosuwaa unttunttu giddon Taani ootsabeennabaa gidintto, unttunttoo nagaraa gidennaan attanawaa; shin ha"i unttunttu Taani ootseedda oosuwaa be'iide, Taanakka Ta Aawuwaakka is's'eeddino. <verse eid="JHN 15:23-24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Shin unttunttu higgiyan, ‹Taana c'oo is's'eeddino› geetettiide s'aafetteeddawe polettana mala, hawe haneedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Maz. 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>«Shin Aawuwaappe yiyaa tumatetsaa Ayyaanay mentsetsiyaawe yaanawaa. Taani Aawuwaappe hinttenttoo Aa yeddana; k'ay I Tabaa markkattanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Hinttekka k'ay kaseppe doommiide, Taananna de'iyaa diraw, Tabaa markkattana.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>«Taani hawaa hinttenttu d'ubettenna mala, hinttenttoo odaaddi. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Unttunttu hinttentta barenttu Ayihuda woosa golliyaappe kessi yeddanawantta. Hewaa bolla k'ay hinttentta wod'iyaa uray S'oossaw ootsiyaawaa aw malatiyaa wodii yaanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Unttunttu hewaa hinttenttu bolla ootsiyaawe Taananne Aawuwaa erenna diraassa. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Shin unttunttu hewaa hinttenttu bolla ootsiyaa wodii gakkiyaa wode, Taani hinttenttoo odeeddawaa hinttenttu hassayana mala, Taani hinttenttoo hawaa odaaddi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Geeshsha Ayaanaa Oosuwaa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Taani hinttenanna de'iyaa diraw, koyro hewaa hinttenttoo odabeykke. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Shin ha"i Taani Taana kiitteeddawaakko bay; shin hintteppe ooninne, ‹Hak'a bay?› giide Taana oochchiyaawe baawa. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Shin Taani hawaa odeedda diraw, hinttenttu wozanaan daro kayyuu de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Shin Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; Taani biyaawe hinttenttoo lo"a. Ayaw gooppe, Taani baana d'ayooppe, mentsetsiyaawe hinttenttukko yeenna; shin Taani booppe, Aa hinttenttukko yeddana. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>K'ay mentsetsiyaawe yiide, unttunttu nagaraabaa, S'oossaa s'illotetsaabaanne pirddaabaa ha sa'aa Asay bayizzeeddawaa bessanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Nagaraabay Asay Taana ammanenna diraassa. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>S'illotetsaabay k'ay Taani Aawuwaakko biyaa diraw, hinttenttu Taana laa'entsuwaa be'ikkita. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>S'oossaa pirddaabay k'ay alamiyaa mooddiyaawe pirddetteedda diraassa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>«Taani hinttenttoo odiyaabay darobay de'ee; shin ha"i hinttenttoo gelenna. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Tumatetsaa Ayyaanay yiyaa wode, hinttentta tumatetsaa ubbaakko kaalletsanawaa. Ayaw gooppe, I bare siseeddawaa odanaappe attin, bareppe ayinne odenna. K'ay sintsappe yaanabaa hinttenttoo I odanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>I Taana bonchchanawaa; ayaw gooppe, I Taw de'iyaawaappe akkiide, hinttenttoo odanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Aawoo de'iyaabay ubbay Tawaa; mentsetsiyaawe Taw de'iyaabaappe akkiide, hinttenttoo odanawaa Taani geeddawe hawaassa.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Kaalliyaawanttu Kayyuu Nashechchaw Laamettana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>«Guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan, hinttenttu Taana be'ikkita; k'ay guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan, hinttenttu Taana be'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Yesuusa kaaliyaawanttuppe ittuu ittuu barenttu giddon, « ‹Guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan, hinttenttu Taana be'ikkita; k'ay guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan, hinttenttu Taana be'anita; ayaw gooppe, Taani Aawuwaakko bay› giyaawe hewe waagiyaawee?» yaageeddino. <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>« ‹Guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan› giyaawe waagiyaawee? I ayaw haasayinttonne nuw erettenna» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Unttunttu barena oochchanaw koyyiyaawaa Yesuusi eriide, unttuntta yaageedda; «Taani, ‹Guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan, hinttenttu Taana be'ikkita; k'ay guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan, hinttenttu Taana be'ana› geeddawoo hinttenttu ittuu ittuwaa oochchiitee? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday. Hinttenttu yeekkananne kayyottana; shin ha alamii nashettana. K'ay hinttenttu kayyottana; shin hinttenttu kayyottowe nashechchaa gidanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Itti mishiratta na'aa yelana haniyaa wode, bare yeliyaa wodii gakkeedda diraw, oyk'ettaw; shin na'ay yeletteeddawaappe guyyiyaan, na'ay ha sa'aan yeletteedda nashechchaa diraw, bare oytsaa hassayukku. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Hewaa diraw, hinttenttukka hinttenttu wozanaan kayyottiita; shin Taani laa'entsuwaa hinttentta be'ana; k'ay hinttenttu wozanay loytsi nashettana; hinttenttu nashechchaa ooninne hintteppe akkena.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>«He gallassi hinttenttu Taana ayinne woossikkita. Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; hinttenttu Ta suntsan woossiyaawaa ubbaa Aawuu hinttenttoo immanawaa. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Ha"i gakkanaw Ta suntsan ayinne woossibeykkita; hinttenttu nashechchay polettana mala, S'oossaa woossite; hinttenttu akkana.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>«Hawaa Taani hinttenttoo leemisuwaan odaaddi; shin Taani leemisuwaan odenna wodii yaanawaa; shin Aawuwaabaa Taani hinttenttoo k'onc'c'iyaan odana. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Taani he gallassi, hinttenttu Ta suntsan Aawuwaa woosana; k'ay hinttenttu diraw, Taani Aawuwaa woosana giikke. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Ayaw gooppe, Aawuu bare huup'ew hinttentta siik'ee; hinttenttu Taana siik'iyaa dirawunne Taani Aawuwaa matappe yeeddawaa ammano diraw, I hinttentta siik'ee. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Taani Aawuwaa matappe ha alamiyaa yaad; k'ay ha alamiyaa aggaade Aawuwaakko baana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu zaariide Yesuusa, «Be'a, ha"i neeni k'onc'c'iyaan haasayaasa; leemisuwaan ayinne haasayakka. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Neeni ubbabaa eriyaawaa nuuni ha"i ereetto; k'ay neena ooninne oochchana mala, neeni koyyennawaa ereetto. Hewe nuuna neeni S'oossaappe yeeddawaa ammantsee» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yesuusi zaariide unttuntta, «Ha"i ammaniitee? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Be'ite, hinttenttu hinttenttu golle golle laalettiyaa wodiinne Ta s'alalaa yeggi bashiyaa wodii yaanawaa; ha"ikka yi diggeedda. Shin Aawuu Taananna de'iyaa diraw, Ta s'alalaa gidikke. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Hinttenttu Ta giddon de'iidde, saro de'ana mala, Taani hawaa hinttenttoo odaaddi. Alamiyaan hinttenttu waayettana. Shin minnite; Taani alamiyaa s'oonaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Woosaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesuusi hewaa haasayeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, pude saluwaa s'eelliide, hawaadan yaageedda; «Ta Aabboo, wodii gakkeedda; ne Na'ay neena bonchchana mala, neenikka ne Na'aa bonchcha. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Ayaw gooppe, neeni aw immeedda ubbaw med'inaa de'uwaa I immana mala, asaa ubbaa bollan aw maataa immaadda. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Asay neena itti tumu S'oossaa gideeddawaa erana malanne, k'ay neeni kiitteedda Yesuusi Kiristtoosa erana mala, hawe med'inaa de'uwaa. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Neeni Taw ootsanaw immeedda oosuwaa polaade, neena sa'aan bonchchaad. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Ha"ikka k'ay Aawoo, alamii med'ettanaappe kase ne matan Taw de'iyaa bonchchuwaan ne sintsan Taana bonchcha.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>«Alamiyaa asaappe neeni Taw immeeddawanttoo ne suntsaa erissaad; unttunttu newantta; k'ay neeni unttuntta Taw immaadda. Unttunttu ne k'aalawukka azazetteeddino. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Ha"i neeni Taw immeedda ubbabay neeppe yeeddawaa unttunttu eriino. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Ayaw gooppe, neeni Taw immeedda k'aalaa Taani unttunttoo immaaddi; unttunttukka he k'aalaa akkeeddino. Taani ne matappe yeeddawe tuma gidiyaawaa eriide Neeni Taana kiitteeddawaakka ammaneeddino.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>«Taani unttunttoo woossay; alamew neena woossikke. Shin Neeni Taw immeedda asaw woossay; ayaw gooppe, unttunttu newantta. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Taw de'iyaa ubbabay nebaa; k'ay New de'iyaa ubbabaykka Tabaa. Taani unttunttu baggana bonchchettaaddi. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Taani hawaappe guyyiyaan, alamiyaan de'ikke; unttunttu alamiyaan de'iino; Taani ha"i neekko bay. Geeshsha Aawoo, ha Neeni Taw immeeddawanttu Neeninne Taani ittuwaa gidiyaawaadan, unttunttu ittuwaa gidana mala, unttuntta ne suntsan naaga. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Taani unttunttunna alamiyaan de'aadde, neeni Taw immeedda ne suntsaa wolk'k'an unttuntta naagaad. Taani unttuntta naagaad; S'oossaa Mas'aafay geeddawe polettana mala, bashshay bessiyaa uraappe attin, unttunttuppe haray ooninne baybeena.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz. 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Yoh. 13:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>«Ha"i Taani Neekko bay; unttunttu wozanaan Ta nashechchay polettana mala, hawaa Taani alamiyaan haasayay. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Taani unttunttoo ne k'aalaa immaaddi; Taani alamiyaassa gidennawaadan, unttunttukka alamiyaassa gidenna diraw, alamii unttuntta is's'eedda. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Neeni s'alahiyaappe unttuntta naagana mala woossiyaawaappe attin, alamiyaappe kessana mala woossikke. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Taani alamiyaassa gidennawaadan, unttunttukka alamiyaassa gidikkino. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Neeni tumatetsaan unttuntta newantta ootsa; ne k'aalaykka tumatetsaa. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Neeni Taana alamiyaa kiitteeddawaadan, Taanikka unttuntta alamiyaa kiittaad; <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>k'ay unttunttu tumatetsaan new dummatana mala, unttunttu diraw, Taani Ta huup'iyaa new dummayaad.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>«Taani unttunttu s'alalaw woossikke; shin unttunttu k'aalaa odina, Taana ammaneeddawanttookka woossay. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Unttunttu ubbay ittuwaa gidana mala, Taani woossay. Aawoo, Neeni Ta giddon de'iyaawaadan, k'ay Taanikka Ne giddon de'iyaawaadan, unttunttu nu giddon de'iino. K'ay neeni Taana kiitteeddawaa alamii ammanana mala, unttunttu ittuwaa gidino. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Neeninne Taani ittuwaa gidiyaawaadan, unttunttu ittuwaa gidana mala, neeni Taana bonchcheeddawaadan, Taanikka unttuntta bonchchaad. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Taani unttunttu giddon de'ina, Neeni Ta giddon de'ina, k'ay Neeni Taana siisiyaawaadan, unttunttakka siik'owaanne Neeni Taana ha alamiyaa kiitteeddawaa alamii eranaadan, unttunttu ubbaa ittuwaa gidino.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>«Aawoo, sa'ay med'ettanaappe kase Neeni Taana siik'eedda diraw, Taw immeedda Ta bonchchuwaa unttunttu be'ana mala, Neeni Taw immeeddawanttu Taani de'iyaa sa'aan Taananna de'ana mala koyaad.<verse eid="JHN 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>«S'illo Aawoo, alamiyaa Asay Neena erenna; shin Taani neena eray. K'ay Neeni Taana kiitteeddawaa hawanttu eriino. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Neeni Taana siik'eedda siik'uu unttunttu giddon de'ana mala, k'ay Taanikka unttunttu giddon de'ana mala, Taani Ne suntsaa unttuntta erissaad; sintsawukka erissana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bare Morkketuwaa Kushiyan Oyk'eteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk'. 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yesuusi hewaa giide, S'oossaa woosseeddawaappe guyyiyaan, barena kaalliyaawanttunna K'ediroona giyaa zanggaaraa pinneedda. He sa'aan atikilttiyaa sa'ay de'ee; Yesuusinne Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu geleeddino. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yesuusa aatsi immeedda Yihuday he sa'aa ereedda; ayaw gooppe, Yesuusi ubbaa wode barena kaalliyaawanttunna hewan shiik'ee. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Hewaa diraw, kaaletsiyaa k'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne Parisaawatuu Yihudaanna baanaadan immeedda Roomaa wotaadaratuunne Geeshsha Golliyaa naagiyaawanttu kuraaziyaa, yabbiyaanne tooraa oyk'k'iide he sa'aa beeddino.<verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yesuusi barena gakkanaw haniyaa ubbabaa eriide, gas'aa kesiide, «Oona koyyiitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Unttunttu zaariide, «Naazireetiyaa Yesuusa koyyeetto» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesuusi zaariide, «Taani Aa» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesuusa aatsi immeedda Yihudaykka hewan unttunttunna ek'k'eedda; <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Yesuusi, «Taani Aa» geedda wode, unttunttu guyyekko shiik'iide, sa'aan kunddeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yesuusi k'aykka, «Oona koyyiitee?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Yaagi oochchina unttunttu, «Naazireetiyaa Yesuusa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Taani Aa gidiyaawaa hinttenttoo odaaddi; simmi hinttenttu Taana koyyiyaawaa gidooppe, hawantta yeddite» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>I, «Ta Aabboo, neeni Taw immeeddawanttuppe haray atto, ittuwaakka bayizzabeykke» geeddawe polettana mala, hewaa geedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Simooni P'es'iroosaw mashshay de'ee; I he mashshaa shoddinne k'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuwaa k'oomaa ushechcha haytsaa shoc'iide, k'ans's'i yeggeedda. He k'oomaa suntsay Malkkoosa. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yesuusi P'es'iroosa, «Ne mashshaa shookuwaan zaaraade wotsa! Ta Aabbu Taw immeedda metuwaa s'uu'aa Taani ushikkitaa?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi K'eesatuwaa Kaappuwaa <optbreak/>Haanna Sintsa Shiik'eedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Shaalak'ay, daro wotaadaratuunne k'ay Geeshsha Golliyaa naagiyaawanttu Yesuusa oyk'k'iide k'achcheeddino. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Koyro Yesuusa Haannakko afeeddino; Haanni he laytsi k'eesatuwaa kaappatuwaa gideedda K'ayaafaa bolluwaa. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>«Asaa ubbaa diraw, itti Asay hayk'k'intto lo"a» giide Ayihudatuwaa zoreeddawe K'ayaafaa.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'es'iroose Yesuusa Kaddeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat. 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar. 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk'. 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simooni P'es'iroosinne hara itti kaalliyaawe Yesuusa kaalliide beeddino. He hara kaalliyaawaa k'eesatuwaa kaappuu ereedda; hewe Yesuusanna k'eesatuwaa kaappuwaa dirssaa garssa geleedda. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Shin P'es'iroose karenna dirssaa penggiyaan ek'k'eedda. K'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuu eriyaa hara kaalliyaawe kare kesiide, penggiyaa naagiyaa naattiw odiide, P'es'iroosa dirssaa garssa gelisseedda. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Penggiyaa naagiyaa naatta P'es'iroosa, «Neeni ha bitaniyaa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuwaa gidikkiiyee?» yaagaaddu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">I, «Tuytti, taani gidikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Sa'ay meeggiyaa diraw, ayilatuunne Geeshsha Golliyaa naagiyaawanttu tamaa ees's'iidde, bonk'k'eeddawaa yuuyyi aad'd'i ek'k'iide kashiino; P'es'iroosikka unttunttunna ek'k'iide, he tamaa kashee.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">K'eesatuwaa Kaappuu Yesuusa Oochcho Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk'. 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>K'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa Kaappuu, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttubaane Aa timirttiyaabaa oochcheedda. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesuusi aw zaariide, «Taani asaa ubbaw k'onc'c'iyaan odaaddi. Taani Ayihuda ubbay shiik'iyaa Ayihuda woosa golleninne Geeshsha Golliyaan ubbaa wode tamaarissaad; geeman ayinne haasayabeykke. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Yaatina, neeni Taana ayaw oochchay? Taani odeeddawaa siseedda asaa oochcha; he Asay Taani odeeddawaa ereedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesuusi hewaa geedda wode, hewaan ek'k'eedda wotaadaratuwaappe ittuu Yesuusa bak'k'iide, «K'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuwaa bolla hawaadan zaaray?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Taani balabaa haasayeeddawaa gidooppe, hawaan de'iyaa asaa ubbaw oda; shin Taani tumuwaa haasayeeddawaa gidooppe, Taana ayaw bak'k'ay?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Hewaa diraw, Haanni, k'ashetti utteedda Yesuusa, k'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuwaa, K'ayaafaakko yeddeedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'es'iroosi Yesuusa Laa'entsuwaa Kaddeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat. 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar. 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk'. 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>P'es'iroosi hewan ek'k'iide, tamaa kashee; haranttu Aa, «Neeni ha bitaniyaa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuwaa gidikkiiyee?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">P'es'iroose, «Tuytti; taani gidikke» yaagiide kaddeedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>K'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuwaa k'oomatuwaappe ittuwaa, P'es'iroose haytsaa k'ans's'eedda bitaniyaa dabbuu P'es'iroosa, «Taani neena aanana daro ataakilttiyaa giddon be'abeykkitayee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>P'es'iroose k'aykka kaddeedda; ellekka kuttuu waassi aggeedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi P'ilaas'oosa Sintsa Shiik'eedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk'. 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Unttunttu Yesuusa K'ayaafaa golleppe Roome asaa ayissiyaawaa ooso golliyaa afeeddino. Sa'ay wontta guura; Ayihudatuu Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassaa k'umaa maanaw, barenttu huup'iyaw tunenna mala, Roome asaa ayissiyaawaa ooso golliyaa gelibeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Hewaa diraw, P'ilaas'oosi unttunttukko kare kesiide, «Ha bitaniyaa hinttenttu ayaan mootiitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Unttunttu, «I iitabaa ootsibeennawaa gidintto, nuuni Aa neekko ahokko» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>P'ilaas'oosi zaariide unttunttoo, «Hinttenttu Aa afiide, hinttenttu higgii giyaawaadan, Aa bolla pirddite» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Ayihudatuu, «Oonanne wod'iyaa maatay nuw baawa» yaageeddino. <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Hawe haneeddawe Yesuusi ay mala hayk'uwaa hayk'k'anentto erissanaw haasayeeddawe polettanaassa.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>P'ilaas'oosi bare oosuwaa golle laa'entsuwaa geliide, Yesuusa s'eesiide, «Neeni Ayihuda kaatee?» yaagiide Aa oochcheedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesuusi P'ilaas'oosa, «Ha ooshaa neeni neeppe oochchayiyee woy hara Asay new tabaa odeeddee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>P'ilaas'oosi zaariide, «Taana Ayihuda asaa gay? Ne zaratuunne k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu neena taw aatsi immeeddino; neeni ayaa ootsaaddii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesuusi, «Ta kawutetsay ha alamiyaanna gidenna. Ta kawutetsay ha alamiyaanna gideeddentto, Taana Ayihudatoo aatsi immennaadan, Taw ootsiyaawanttu Taw olettana; shin Ta kawutetsay ha alamiyaana gidenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Hewaa diraw, P'ilaas'oosi Yesuusa, «Yaatina, neeni kaateeyye?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesuusi zaariide, «Neeni Taana kaatiyaa gaadda. Taani tumuwaa markkattana diraw yelettaad; k'ay hewaa diraw, ha alamiyaa yaad. Tumuwaa bagga gideedda ooninne Taani giyaawaa siseedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>P'ilaas'oosi, «Tumuu ayee?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">P'ilaas'oosi hewaa geeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Ayihudatuwaakko kare kesiide, «Taani aan ay balaanne demmabeykke. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Shin Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassi, itti asaa taani hinttenttoo k'ashuwaappe billiyaa dooyay de'ee; taani hinttenttoo Ayihudatuu kaatiyaa billiyaawaa koyyiitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Unttunttu zaariide, barenttu kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Barbbaana billappe attin, Aa gidenna!» yaageeddino. Shin Barbbaani paannuwaa.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="s">Wotaadaratuu Yesuusa Bolla K'illiic'c'eeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-32">Mat. 27:27-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:15-21">Mar. 15:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, P'ilaas'oosi Yesuusa oyk'k'iide, lissuwaan shoc'eedda. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Wotaadaratuu aguntsaappe kalachchaa giigissiide, Aa huup'iyaan wotseeddino; k'ay zo'o mayuwaakka Aa mayzzeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Aakko shiik'iide, «Ayihuda kaatew, shemppuwaa gam"a!» yaagiide Aa shayiyaa bak'k'eeddino.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>P'ilaas'oosi k'aykka kare kesiide Ayihudatuwaa, «Be'ite, taani aan ay balaanne demmabeennawaa hinttenttu erana mala, Aa hinttenttukko kare kessana» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi aguntsaa kalachchaa bare huup'iyaan wotsiide, zo'o mayuwaa mayyiide, kare kesseedda; P'ilaas'oosi Ayihudatuwaa, «Bitaniyaa hawaa be'ite» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>K'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne wotaadaratuu Aa be'eedda wode, barenttu kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishaade Aa sulla! Sulla!» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">P'ilaas'oosi unttuntta, «Hinttenttu Aa afiide, mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishiide sullite; ayaw gooppe, taani ay balaanne demmabeykke» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Ayihudatuu zaariide, «Nuw higgii de'ee; nu higgii giyaawaadan, I hayk'k'anaw bessee; ayaw gooppe, I barena S'oossaa Na'aa ootseedda» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>P'ilaas'oosi hewaa siseedda wode, kasewaappe loytsi yayyeedda. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>K'aykka P'ilaas'oosi bare oosuwaa golle simmi geliide Yesuusa, «Neeni hak'appe yaaddii?» yaagiide oochcheedda; shin Yesuusi aw aynne zaaribeenna. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Hewaa diraw, P'ilaas'oosi Aa, «Taw odikkii? Neena billanaw woy mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishaade kak'k'anaw taw maatay de'iyaawaa erikkiiyye?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesuusi, «S'oossay new bollappe maataa immibeennabaa gidintto, new Ta bolla maatay de'enna shin. Hewaa diraw, Taana new aatsi immeeddawe aad'd'iyaa nagaraa ootseedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Hayk'oo Pirddeeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat. 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mar. 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk'. 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>P'ilaas'oosi hewaa siseedda wode, Yesuusa billanaw ogiyaa koyyeedda; shin Ayihudatuu barenttu kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Neeni Aa billiyaawaa gidooppe, Kaatiyaa K'eesaare dabbo gidakka! Barena kaatiyaa giyaa ooninne K'eesaare morkke!» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>P'ilaas'oosi hewaa sisiide, Yesuusa kare kesseedda. Yaatiide shuchchaa baasuwaa giyaa sa'aan pirddaa oydiyaan utteedda; Ibraayiss's'e k'aalaan he sa'ay gaytaa giyaawaa. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>He gallassay Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassaw giigissiyaa gallassaa; sa'ay usuppun saatiyaa heera gidanawaa. P'ilaas'oosi Ayihudatuwaa, «Hinttenttu kaatiyaa hawaa be'ite!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Ayihudatuu barenttu kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Digga! Digga! Mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishaade sulla!» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">P'ilaas'oosi zaariide, «Hinttenttu kaatiyaa taani mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishaade sulliyaawaa koyyiitee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">K'eesatuwaa kaappatuu, «K'eesaareppe hara kaatii nuw baawa!» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, unttunttu mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishiide, Yesuusa kak'k'ana mala, P'ilaas'oosi unttunttoo aatsi immeedda.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesuusa Sulleeddino</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk'. 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Unttunttu Yesuusa oyk'k'iide, afeeddino. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Yesuusi bare mask'k'aliyaa tookkiide, Guuggiyaasaa geetettiyaasaa beedda. «Guuggiyaasaa»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">«Guuggiyaasaa» </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hewaan asaa guuggiyaa malati med'etteedda wogga shuchchay de'iyaa diraw, «Guuggiyaasaa geetetteedda».</char></note> giyaawe Ibraayiss's'e k'aalaan «Golggootaa» giyaawaa. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Unttunttu he sa'aan mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishiide, Yesuusa kak'k'eeddino; k'ay aanana hara laa"u asatuu, ittuwaa ya baggana k'ay ittuwaa ha baggana Yesuusa gidduwaan wotsiide, mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishiide kak'k'eeddino. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>P'ilaas'oosi s'ifatiyaa s'aafiide, mask'k'aliyaa bolla wotseedda. I s'aafeeddawe, «Ayihudatuu Kaatiyaa, Naazireetiyaa Yesuusa» yaagee. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Yesuusi mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishettiide suletteedda sa'ay katamaa matan de'iyaa diraw, daro Ayihudatuu he s'ifatiyaa nabbabeeddino. S'ifatii Ibraayiss's'e k'aalaan, Roomayss's'e k'aalaaninne Giriike k'aalaan s'aafetteedda. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Hewaa diraw, Ayihuda k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu P'ilaas'oosa, « ‹Ha bitanii barena Ayihuda kaatiyaa yaageedda› gaade s'aafappe attin, ‹Ayihuda kaatiyaa› gaade s'aafoppa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>P'ilaas'oosi, «Taani s'aafeeddawaa s'aafa diggaad» yaagiide zaareedda.<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Wotaadaratuu mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishiide, Yesuusa kak'k'eeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Aa mayuwaa akkiide, oyddu kessi shaakkeeddino; itti itti wotaadaraa itti shaakuu gakkeedda. Aa adussa mayuwaakka akkeeddino; adussa mayuu hashiyaappe doommiide, duge gakkanaw yeddi mayettiyaawaappe attin, k'ans's'ettiide sikettibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Wotaadaratuu ittuu ittuwaa, «Oona gakkanentto, saamaa woy es'aa yegganaappe attin, mayuwaa peed'okko» yaageeddino. Hewe haneeddawe S'oossaa Mas'aafay, «Ta mayuwaa shaakki akkeeddino; ta adussa mayuwaan saamaa yeggeeddino» giyaawe polettanaassa. Hewaa diraw, wotaadaratuu hewaa ootseeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz. 22:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Shin Yesuusa mask'k'aliyaa matan Aa daaya, Aa aatti michchata, K'aliyoop'aa machchata Mayraamanne Magdala geetettiyaa katamaappe yeedda Mayraama ek'k'eeddino. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yesuusi bare daayanne I siik'iyaa kaalliyaawe hewan ek'k'eeddawantta be'iide, bare daayo, «Ha mishirattee, ne na'aa hawaa be'a!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, he kaalliyaawaa «Ne daayo hanno be'a!» yaageedda. He kaalliyaawe izo he saatiyaappe doommiide, bare soy afeedda.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Hayk'uwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk'. 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi ubbabay hak'i poletteeddawaa eriide, S'oossaa Mas'aafay geeddawe polettana mala, «Taana saammee» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz. 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>He sa'aan itti s'uggaa kumeedda c'aala woyniyaa eessay de'ee. Unttunttu ispponjjiyaa he woyniyaa eessaan yeggiide, hisoop'p'iyaa geetettiyaa mitsaa s'eeraan wotsiide, Yesuusa doonaakko shiishsheeddino. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesuusi woyniyaa eessaa gans's'i be'eeddawaappe guyyiyaan, «Poletteedda» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:30">Yesuusa Miyyiyaa Tooraan C'addeeddino</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">K'ay hewaappe guyyiyaan, bare huup'iyaa toochchiide, bare shemppuwaa immeedda.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>He gallassay Ayihudatoo giigettiyaa gallassaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ayihudatoo giigettiyaa gallassaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paasigay saaminttaappe itti gallassaa awudenne gidana danddayee; shin Yohaannisa mishiraachchuu tamaarissiyaawaadan, Paasigaa wodii hananaw bessiyaawe, laytsaa laytsaan Yesuusi mask'k'aliyan kak'etti hayk'k'eedda sambbataana gidana koshshee.</char></note> gidiyaa dirawunne k'ay he Sambbatay daro bonchcho gidiyaa diraw, Sambbataan asatuwaa anhay mask'k'aliyaa bolla peeshenna mala, suletteedda asatuwaa suyiliyaa mentsiide,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Suletteedda asatuwaa suyiliyaa mentsiide: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha wogay Roome kawutetsaa wogaadan, mask'k'aliyan suletteedda asatuu ellekka hayk'k'ana mala ootsiyaa ogiyaa guussaa.</char></note> mask'k'aliyaappe wotsana mala, Ayihudatuu P'ilaas'oosa woosseeddino. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Hewaa diraw, wotaadaratuu yiide, Yesuusanna suletteedda koyro bitaniyaa suyiliyaa mentseeddino; k'ay aanana suletteedda laa'entso bitaniyaa suyiliyaakka mentseeddino. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Shin Yesuusakko yeedda wode I hayk'k'i diggeeddawaa be'iide, Aa suyiliyaa mentsibeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Gidooppenne, wotaadaratuwaappe ittuu Aa miyyiyaa tooraan c'addeedda. Ellekka suutsaynne haatsay goggi aggeedda. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Hinttenttu ammanana mala, hawaa be'eeddawe markkatteedda; I markkattiyaawekka tumuwaa; k'ay bare haasayay tuma gidiyaawaa I ereedda. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Hewe haneeddawe S'oossaa Mas'aafay, «Aa mek'etsatuwaappe ittuunne me"enna» geeddawe polettanaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Kes. 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Pay. 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Maz. 34:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>K'aykka S'oossaa Mas'aafay haray, «Asay bare c'addeeddawaa be'ana» yaagee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zak. 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Sas'. 1:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Moogetteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk'. 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Armmaatiyaasa geetettiyaa katamaappe yeedda Yooseefo Yesuusa anhaa akkiide afanaw P'ilaas'oosa woosseedda; Yooseefo Ayihudatoo yayyeedda diraw, Asay erennaan Yesuusa kaalliyaawaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:38">Yooseefo woossina P'ilaas'oosi, «Afa» yaageedda. Hewaa diraw, Yooseefo biide, Yesuusa anhaa afeedda. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>K'ay Nik'oodimoosi hewaappe kase Yesuusakko k'amma yeeddawe, kawaraannanne godare uutsaanna walaketteedda oytamanne ichcheshu kiilo giraame gidiyaawaa keena shittuwaa oyk'k'i akkiide, Yooseefonna yeedda. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>He laa"u asatuu Yesuusa anhaa akkiide, Ayihudatuu anhaa s'aas'iyaa wogaadan, shittuwaanna gatsiide, mooguwaa afilaan s'aas'eeddino. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Yesuusi mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishettiide suletteedda sa'aan daro atikilttiyaa sa'ay de'ee; he atikilttiyaa sa'aa giddon shuchchaa wooc'i kesseedda biro ooninne moogettibeenna ooratsa duufuu de'ee. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>He duufuu matan de'iyaa dirawunne k'ay Ayihudatuu Sambbataw giigettiyaa gallassaa gidiyaa diraw, Yesuusa yaan wotseeddino.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Hayk'uwaappe Denddeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat. 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk'. 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Wogaa gallassi guuran, biro daabidaabiyaawaan, Magdala geetettiyaa katamaappe yeedda Mayraama Yesuusi moogetteedda duufuwaakko baade shuchchay he gonggoluwaa doonaappe denddikichcheeddawaa be'aaddu. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Simooni P'es'iroosakkonne Yesuusi siik'iyaa yekko kaalliyaawaakko, iza wos's'aadde baade, «Duufuwaappe Godaa afi diggeeddino; hak'an Aa wotseeddinonttonne nuuni erokko» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Hewaa diraw, P'es'iroosinne yekko kaalliyaawe aggiide, duufuwaakko beeddino. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Laa"uukka ittippe wos's'eeddino; shin yekko kaalliyaawe P'es'iroosappe aad'd'i kasetiide, he duufuwaakko gakkeedda. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>He kaalliyaawe hokkiide, mooguwaa afilaa be'eedda; shin giddo gelibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simooni P'es'iroose Aa kaalli yiide, duufuwaa giddo geleedda. Yaatiide mooguwaa afilay hewan de'iyaawaa be'eedda; <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>k'ay Yesuusa huup'iyaan s'aas'etti utteedda afilay he s'aas'etteeddawaadankka dumma itti sa'aan de'iyaawaa be'eedda; he afilay dumma de'eeppe attin, mooguwaa afilaanna ittippe de'enna. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>He wode, kasetiide gonggoluwaakko gakkeedda yekko kaalliyaawe geli be'iide ammaneedda. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Yesuusi hayk'uwaappe denddanaw bessiyaawaa odiyaa S'oossaa mas'aafaa unttunttu biro akeekibeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, kaalliyaawanttu barenttu golle simmiide beeddino.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Magdala Mayraamiw Beetteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat. 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar. 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Shin Mayraama he duufuwaa doonaan ek'k'aade yeekkaadde hokkaade duufuwaa giddo s'eellaaddu. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>Bootsa mayuwaa mayyeedda laa"u kiitanchchatuu Yesuusa anhay giseedda sa'aan ittuu huup'issanna ittuu gedissanna utteeddawantta be'aaddu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Unttunttu izo, «Mishirattee, ayaw yeekkay?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Iza, «Asatuu ta Godaa afi diggeeddino; unttunttu hak'an wotseeddinonttonne taani erikke» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Hewaa geeddawaappe guyyiyaan, guyye simma s'eellaade, Yesuusi ek'k'eeddawaa be"aaddu. Shin I Yesuusa gideeddawaa akeekabeyikku. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesuusi izo, «Mishirattee, ayaw yeekkay? Oona koyyay?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Mayraama atikilttiyaa naagiyaawaa gaade, «Godaw, neeni akkeeddawaa gidooppe, Aa hak'an wotsaaddintto, taw odaarikkii; taani Aa akkana» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesuusi izo, «Mayraamee» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Aa aakko simmaade, Ibraayiss's'e k'aalaan «Rabunii» yaagaaddu; hewaa biletsay «Tamaarissiyaawoo» giyaawaa.<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesuusi izo, «Taani biro Ta Aawuwaakko babeena diraw, Taana bochchoppa; shin Ta ishatuwaakko baade, ‹Taani Ta Aawuwaakkonne hinttenttu Aawuwaakko, Ta S'oossaakkonne hinttenttu S'oossaakko, pude bay geedda› gaade unttunttoo oda» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Magdala geetettiyaa katamaappe yeedda Mayraama Godaa be'eeddawaanne iziw I hewaa odeeddawaa baade kaalliyaawanttoo odaaddu.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bare Kaalliyaawanttoo Beetteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk'. 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>He Wogaa gallassi omarssi, kaalliyaawanttu Ayihudatoo yayyeedda diraw, penggiyaa gorddiidde, shiik'i utti de'ishshin, Yesuusi yiide, unttunttu gidduwaan ek'k'iide, «Sarotetsay hinttenttoo gido» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Hewaa geeddawaappe guyyiyaan, bare kushiyaanne bare miyyiyaa unttuntta besseedda; kaalliyaawanttu Godaa be'eedda wode loytsi nashetteeddino. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesuusi laa'entsuwaa unttunttoo, «Sarotetsay hinttenttoo gido; Ta Aabbu Taana kiitteeddawaadan, Taanikka hinttentta kiittay» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Hewaa geeddawaappe guyyiyaan, unttunttu bolla ufu giide shemppeedda; k'ay, «Geeshsha Ayaanaa akkite. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Hinttenttu atto geedda asaa nagaray atto geetettanawaa; hinttenttu atto geenawanttu nagaray atto geetettenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Toomaasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Shin tammanne laa"u kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu, Manttiyaa giyaa Toomaasi, Yesuusi yeedda wode unttunttunna baawa. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Hewaa diraw, yekko kaalliyaawanttu Toomaasaw, «Nuuni Godaa be'eeddo!» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Shin Toomaasi unttunttoo, «Misimaariyan I c'adetteedda Aa kushiyan de'iyaa mallaa be'ennaaninne he mallaa ta birad'd'iyan bochchennan, k'ay ta kushiyaa Aa miyyiyaan yeedda be'ennaan taani ammanikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Saaminttaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu k'aykka gollen shiik'i utteeddino; Toomaasikka unttunttunna de'ee. Penggii k'ashetti utti de'ishshin, Yesuusi yiide, unttunttu gidduwaan ek'k'iide, «Sarotetsay hinttenttoo gido» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi Toomaasa, «Ne kushiyaa haa ahaade, Ta kushiyaa be'a, k'ay ne kushiyaa haa ahaade, Ta miyyiyaan yeedda be'a, neeni ammaniyaawaa gidappe attin, ammanennawaa gidoppa!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Toomaasi zaariide, «Ta Godaw, ta S'oossaw!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yesuusi, «Neeni Taana be'eedda diraw ammanaadda; be'ennaan ammaneeddawanttu anjjetteeddawantta» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ha Mas'aafaa K'ofaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesuusi ha mas'aafan s'aafettibeenna hara daro malaatatuwaa barena kaalliyaawanttu sintsan ootseedda. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Shin Yesuusi, I Kiristtoosa, S'oossaa Na'aa gidiyaawaa hinttenttu ammanana malanne, k'ay Aa ammaniide Aa suntsan de'uwaa hinttenttu demmana mala, hawe s'aafetteedda.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Laappu Kaalliyaawanttoo Beetteedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi S'ibiriyaadoosa geetettiyaa abbaa gas'aan bare kaalliyaawanttoo laa'entsuwaa beetteedda. I unttunttoo hawaadan beetteedda. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simooni P'es'iroosinne manttiyaa geetettiyaa Toomaasi, K'aanaa Galiilaappe yeedda Naatinaa'eeli, Zabddiyoosa naanaynne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Zabddiyoosa naanaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishatuwaa gideedda Yaak'oobanne Yohaannisa.</char></note> Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe hara laa"atuu ittippe de'iino.<verse eid="JHN 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simooni P'es'iroose unttunttoo, «Taani moliyaa oyk'k'anaw bay» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Unttunttu, «Nuunikka neenanna baana» yaagiide, kesiide wonggiriyaa giddo geleeddino; shin unttunttu he gallassi k'amma moliyaa ayinne oyk'k'ibeykkino.<verse eid="JHN 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Wonttiyaa wode away kessanaappe kase, Yesuusi abbaa gas'aan ek'k'eedda; shin Aa kaalliyaawanttu Yesuusa gideeddawaa eribeykkino. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Naatoo, moliyaa oyk'k'ibeykkiteeyye?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Unttunttu zaariide, «Ayinne oyk'k'ibeykko» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>I zaariide, «Hinttenttu dabbaa wonggiriyaappe ushechcha baggakko yeggite; amareedawaa hinttenttu oyk'k'ana» yaageedda. Hewaa diraw, dabbaa ushechcha baggakko yeggina, molii dareedda diraw, goochchi kessanawe unttuntta s'ooneedda.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Yesuusi siik'iyaa Aa kaalliyaawe P'es'iroosa, «Hawe Godaattennee!» yaageedda. Simooni P'es'iroose Godaa I gideeddawaa siseedda wode, kallo de'iyaa diraw, bare mayuwaa mayyiide, abbaa giddo guppi geleedda. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Shin yekko kaalliyaawanttu molii kumi utteedda dabbaa goochchiide, wonggiriyaan abbaappe gas'aa kesseeddino; unttunttu abbaappe laa"u s'eetu wad'aa keenaa haakkiide de'iinoppe attin, loytsi haakkiide de'ikkino. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Unttunttu abbaappe gas'aa kesseedda wode, s'iis'untsaa bonk'k'uwaan molii de'iyaawaanne ukitsaa be'eeddino.<verse eid="JHN 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Ha"i hinttenttu oyk'k'eedda moliyaappe amareedawaa haammite» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simooni P'es'iroose wonggiriyaan geliide, s'eetanne ishatamanne heezzu wogga moletuu kumi utteedda dabbaa goochchiide, abbaappe gas'aa kesseedda; molii hewaa keena daro gidinakka dabbay daakettibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Ha yiide, k'an"iyaa k'an"ite» yaageedda. Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuunne, «Neeni oonee?» giide Aa oochchanaw s'alibeenna; ayaw gooppe, Godaa I gideeddawaa unttunttu ereeddino. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yesuusi yiide, ukitsaa akkiide, unttunttoo immeedda; moliyaakka hewaadan immeedda.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Yesuusi hayk'uwaappe denddeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, bare kaalliyaawanttoo beettishshin hawe heezzentsuwaa.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne P'es'iroosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Unttunttu k'umaa meeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi Simooni P'es'iroosa, «Yohaannisa na'aa Simoonaa, Taana hawanttuppe aatsaade siik'ay?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">«Taana hawanttuppe aatsaade siik'ay?» </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay, «Taana ha yewatuwaa siik'iyaawaappe aatsaade siik'ay?» guussaa.</char></note> yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Simooni P'es'iroose, «Ee Godaw, taani neena dosiyaawaa neeni eraasa» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesuusi Aa, «Ta dorssaa maratuwaa heemma» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Yesuusi k'aykka, «Yohaannisa na'aa Simoonaa, Taana siik'ay?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Simooni P'es'iroose, «Ee Godaw, taani neena dosiyaawaa neeni eraasa» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesuusi, «Ta dorssatuwaa heemma» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Yesuusi heezzentsuwaa, «Yohaannisa na'aa Simoonaa, Taana dosay?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesuusi heezzentsuwaa Simooni P'es'iroosa, «Taana dosay?» yaagiide oochcheedda diraw, P'es'iroose kayyottiidde, «Godaw, neeni ubbabaa eraasa; taani neena dosiyaawaa neeni eraasa» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesuusi, «Ta dorssatuwaa heemma. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Taani new tumuwaa oday; neeni wodallatetsaan de'iyaa wode, ne s'eessan sak'k'iyaa neerekka danc'c'aade, neeni koyyeeddasaa baasa. Shin c'imeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, ne kushiyaa mic'c'a bessaasa. Neena hara uray danc'c'issanawaa; neeni dosennasaakka afee» yaageedda. <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Yesuusi hewaa P'es'iroose ay mala hayk'uwaa hayk'k'iide, S'oossaa bonchchissanenttonne erissanaw geedda; k'ay hewaa geeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi P'es'iroosa, «Taana kaala» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Yekko Kaalliyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>P'es'iroose guyye simmiide, Yesuusi siik'iyaa kaalliyaawe bareppe guyyenna yiyaawaa be'eedda; he kaalliyaawe kawuwaa miyaa sa'aan Yesuusakko shiik'iide Aa, «Godaw, neena aatsi immanawe oonee?» yaageeddawaa. <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>P'es'iroose he kaalliyaawaa be'iide Yesuusa, «Godaw, ha bitanii k'ay waananee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesuusi Aa, «Taani yaana gakkanaw I de'ana mala Taani koyyooppe, hewe neena ayaa metii? Neeni Taana kaala» yaageedda.<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Hewaa diraw, he kaalliyaawe hayk'k'enna giyaa haasayay ishatuwaa ubbaakko gakkeedda; shin Yesuusi, «Taani yaana gakkanaw, I de'ana mala, Taani koyyooppe, neena ayaa metii?» geeddawaappe attin, «Hayk'k'enna» gibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>He yewuwaabaa markkatteeddawenne k'ay hewaa s'aafeeddawe he kaalliyaawaa Aa markkatetsay tuma gidiyaawaa nuuni ereetto.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Yesuusi ootseedda hara darobaykka de'ee; ubbabay huup'iyaan huup'iyaan s'aafettintto, s'aafettiyaa mas'aafatoo ha mule alamii gidanawaa taw malatenna.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
